    </node>
    <node id="&quot;INT_MAX&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"INT_MAX 是 C++ 中表示整数最大值的常量，用于初始化最小敲碎数 Min，是程序中用于算法优化的技术实现细节。"&lt;SEP&gt;"INT_MAX是C++中表示整数最大值的常量，被学生程序用于初始化答案和作为边界值以简化数组越界处理。"</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-5d38e5622408383b4738c3d567bf0a9c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a0e2ac3fe25900f76cfe73eedcd9570d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;A[N + 1]&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"GEO"</data>
      <data key="d1">"a[n + 1]是学生程序中人为扩展的数组边界元素，赋值为INT_MAX以避免在循环中处理越界情况，属于编程技巧性构造。"</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-5d38e5622408383b4738c3d567bf0a9c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;OI-WIKI&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"OI-Wiki is an online resource providing educational content on competitive programming, including bit operations such as XOR and GCD, referenced in the problem for further learning."&lt;SEP&gt;"OI-Wiki is an online resource providing educational content on competitive programming, including bit operations such as XOR and GCD, referenced in the problem for further learning."&lt;SEP&gt;"OI-Wiki is an online resource providing educational content on competitive programming, including bit operations such as XOR and GCD, referenced in the problem for further learning."&lt;SEP&gt;"OI-Wiki is an online resource providing educational content on competitive programming, including bit operations such as XOR and GCD, referenced in the problem statement for further learning."&lt;SEP&gt;"OI-Wiki是一个提供信息学竞赛相关知识的在线资源平台，被引用为位运算知识的参考资料，网址为https://oi-wiki.org/math/bit/#%E4%B8%8E%E6%88%96%E5%BC%82%E6%88%96。"&lt;SEP&gt;"OI-Wiki是一个提供算法竞赛相关知识的在线资源平台，被引用为位运算知识的参考资料。"&lt;SEP&gt;"OI-Wiki 是一个面向信息学竞赛的在线知识库，提供位运算等算法的详细解释和示例，被引用为学习资源。"&lt;SEP&gt;"OI-Wiki是一个提供信息学竞赛相关知识的在线资源平台，被引用为位运算知识的参考资料。"&lt;SEP&gt;"OI-Wiki是一个提供算法竞赛相关知识的在线资源组织，其中包含位运算的详细解释，被引用为学习参考资料。"&lt;SEP&gt;"OI-Wiki是一个提供信息学竞赛相关知识的在线资源平台，被引用为位运算知识的参考资料。"&lt;SEP&gt;"OI-Wiki是一个提供信息学竞赛相关知识的在线资源平台，包含位运算的详细说明，被引用为学习参考资料。"&lt;SEP&gt;"OI-Wiki是一个提供信息学竞赛相关知识的在线资源平台，被引用为位运算知识的参考资料。"</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-5c558efa82eea3b35fae76cbadb1eff6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d78f2079f220a0196b9a21caa622db85&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff32fffb52415ec4221990a56352b068&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a51b47f04a5032a9117dced97c6aa7a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c0621f867e87fb25088a534465259d65&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2e96fe33a652d98236ab6e39e9022dc7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0912d8b8a7e5a597e50db3ea5336268a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-292b69dd280ff7c3c431c909f2fa1f47&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-740455e328e2f67f25cee018470473d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-337f6c50a6fc0269c78db8502813c381&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-545d80205967186bbfce4955f69aa723</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;小苯&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"小苯 is the protagonist in the problem scenario, who is given an array of integers and seeks to count pairs satisfying the condition a_i XOR a_j = GCD(a_i, a_j)."&lt;SEP&gt;"小苯 is the protagonist in the problem statement, who is given an array of integers and seeks to count pairs satisfying the condition a_i XOR a_j = gcd(a_i, a_j)."&lt;SEP&gt;"小苯 is the protagonist in the problem statement, who is given an array of integers and seeks to count pairs satisfying the condition a_i XOR a_j = gcd(a_i, a_j)."&lt;SEP&gt;"小苯 is the protagonist in the problem, who is given an array of integers and seeks to count pairs satisfying the condition a_i XOR a_j = gcd(a_i, a_j)."&lt;SEP&gt;"小苯是题目中的主角，负责处理一个包含n个整数的数组，并寻找满足a_i xor a_j = gcd(a_i, a_j)的元素对数量。"</data>
