      <data key="d0">"GEO"</data>
      <data key="d1">"a_j denotes the j-th element in the array (where j &gt; i), functioning as a second discrete point in the same numerical space, paired with a_i to evaluate the condition a_i xor a_j = gcd(a_i, a_j)."&lt;SEP&gt;"a_j denotes the j-th element in the integer array (where j &gt; i), forming a pair with a_i to evaluate the condition a_i XOR a_j = gcd(a_i, a_j)."</data>
