      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A conceptual category of programming knowledge involving linear data structures with nodes connected by pointers, classified here as per entity type constraints."&lt;SEP&gt;"No linked list structure is used; the array is stored as a static array."&lt;SEP&gt;"A dynamic data structure composed of nodes with pointers to next (and possibly previous) elements; commonly used in problems requiring frequent insertions/deletions; not referenced in error, indicating likely proficiency."&lt;SEP&gt;"A dynamic data structure consisting of nodes linked by pointers; not mentioned in error context, so assumed to be understood."&lt;SEP&gt;"A knowledge point concerning linked data structures; not mentioned in error description, so student likely has good grasp."&lt;SEP&gt;"Good: No linked list structures or pointer manipulations are used. The code relies on static arrays, which is suitable for the problem. The student’s choice reflects correct understanding of data structure suitability."&lt;SEP&gt;"A linear data structure composed of nodes; no indication of linked structures in the code or problem context."&lt;SEP&gt;"This knowledge point is not applicable; no linked data structures are used or referenced."&lt;SEP&gt;"No linked list structures or operations are used or implied in the code."&lt;SEP&gt;"A knowledge point involving dynamically linked data elements — not relevant as the student’s code uses arrays, not linked lists."&lt;SEP&gt;"A data structure consisting of nodes linked by pointers, commonly used for dynamic memory allocation and efficient insertions/deletions."&lt;SEP&gt;"A knowledge point referring to the understanding and implementation of linked list data structures; not explicitly marked as good or bad in the provided text."&lt;SEP&gt;"Linked_List is a data structure consisting of nodes connected by pointers, used to dynamically manage collections of elements with efficient insertions and deletions."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-5667e6d6ac2a6898d54282e5227a0e3e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64a0b2fc78e14ac24b3790b183153e20&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-13d0c437f60ca3acd04da12cb2b56d6d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e14c1d7f404ce9578e01e19f11a846b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f665337d67097145c49cecab1e3e3e6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f2c13e4dc0c5ffdeff6ad422bae25f5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db56fdcd4cd90d637f9116210b9583eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-822eea5aa72002e3d106bf0be08669dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eead988a81ce4ca9e3ae8f503d1cfe1c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f44ccaba75ddd991df3ba87881e905b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34990b1b85de7de8bbd3a8165873d9e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6eb1e0de0dc9a052c0705514de52b278</data>
