    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GRID GRAPH&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"GRAPH_STRUCTURE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The grid represented by matrix a[i][j] with dimensions n x m functions as a graph where each cell is a node connected to its four neighbors (up, down, left, right), used for BFS traversal."</data>
