      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The student's submission contained no error, indicating correct application of one or more of the listed knowledge points."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-eead988a81ce4ca9e3ae8f503d1cfe1c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BAD: INPUT_OUTPUT_AND_SEQUENTIAL_STRUCTURE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"KNOWLEDGE_POINT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Student program uses standard input/output with std::cin.tie(nullptr), indicating awareness of I/O optimization, but the error score of 18.75% suggests possible incorrect handling of input format or sequential query processing."</data>
