    <node id="&quot;RECORD ID: 109-1&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"GEO"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A unique identifier for a student submission record, associated with a timestamp indicating when the submission was made."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-5667e6d6ac2a6898d54282e5227a0e3e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;2025-02-11 14:08:16&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"GEO"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The timestamp indicating the exact time of the student submission, used for tracking and record-keeping purposes."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-5667e6d6ac2a6898d54282e5227a0e3e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CORRECT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The student's submission was marked as correct, with a score of 18.75, indicating successful problem resolution according to the evaluation criteria."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-5667e6d6ac2a6898d54282e5227a0e3e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;18.75&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"GEO"</data>
      <data key="d1">"18.75 is a score representing the student's performance on a programming problem, likely out of a possible 100 points, indicating partial but incomplete mastery of the required concepts."&lt;SEP&gt;"The numerical score awarded to the student's submission, indicating partial or full correctness in solving the problem based on the known evaluation rubric."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-5667e6d6ac2a6898d54282e5227a0e3e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34990b1b85de7de8bbd3a8165873d9e7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;C_I&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"GEO"</data>
      <data key="d1">"c_i是第i次查询的指定位置，满足l_i ≤ c_i ≤ r_i，用于确定原数组中待追踪元素的初始位置。"</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-d3220ac1e2b38ea3962a2cf303acd6f9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;排列 P&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"排列 p 是一个由1到n的整数构成的序列，每个元素唯一，是问题处理的核心数据结构，用于执行区间排序与位置追踪操作。"</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-d3220ac1e2b38ea3962a2cf303acd6f9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;子区间 [L_I, R_I]&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"子区间 [l_i, r_i] 是排列 p 中的一个连续子段，每次查询对该子段进行升序排序，是问题操作的基本单位。"</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-d3220ac1e2b38ea3962a2cf303acd6f9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;排序后位置查询&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"排序后位置查询是本题的核心任务，即在对子区间排序后，追踪原位置 c_i 处元素在新序列中的新索引位置。"</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-d3220ac1e2b38ea3962a2cf303acd6f9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;110-1&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"110-1 is a record identifier for a student submission in an educational assessment system, used to track individual performance on programming problems."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-34990b1b85de7de8bbd3a8165873d9e7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;2025-02-11 14:08:37&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"This timestamp marks the exact time of submission for record ID 110-1, indicating when the student's answer was recorded in the system."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-34990b1b85de7de8bbd3a8165873d9e7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;排列&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"在本题语境中，‘排列’指由1到n的整数构成的有序数组，是算法问题的核心数据结构，虽为数学概念，但在编程竞赛中被当作处理对象，故归类为organization以体现其作为系统性处理单元的角色。"</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-2d03c8a658a097369f0ad11e46b54696</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;子区间[L_I,R_I]&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"子区间[l_i,r_i]是每次查询中被独立排序的数组片段，是问题中关键的操作单元，代表一次独立的算法处理事件。"</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-2d03c8a658a097369f0ad11e46b54696</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;位置C_I&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"位置c_i是查询中指定的原始索引，用于追踪排序后该位置元素的移动目标，是每次查询的核心关注点。"</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-2d03c8a658a097369f0ad11e46b54696</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;M次询问&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"m次询问代表对同一排列进行的m次独立查询操作，构成问题的输入规模和处理流程，是算法效率评估的关键维度。"</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-2d03c8a658a097369f0ad11e46b54696</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CHECKER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"checker是用于验证学生程序输出正确性的自动化校验工具，本题中因复杂度问题无法正确实现，是题目设计中的关键验证组件。"</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-2d03c8a658a097369f0ad11e46b54696</data>
    </node>
    <edge source="&quot;小红&quot;" target="&quot;长度为K的连续子数组&quot;">
      <data key="d3">81.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"小红定义了'好数组'的条件，直接决定了如何判断长度为k的连续子数组是否符合要求。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小红定义了'好数组'的标准，直接决定了长度为k的连续子数组是否符合要求，是问题逻辑的源头。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小红提出了计算长度为k的连续子数组中'好数组'数量的问题，因此直接关联该事件。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小红提出了计算长度为k的连续子数组中'好数组'数量的问题，因此直接关联该事件的定义与求解目标。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小红定义了'好数组'的条件，这些条件直接应用于长度为k的连续子数组的判断，因此她提出了该事件的评估标准。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小红提出了判断长度为k的连续子数组是否为'好数组'的问题，是该事件的定义者和需求提出者。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小红提出了判断长度为k的连续子数组是否为'好数组'的问题，定义了其数学性质并要求统计数量，是问题的提出者与目标对象的关系。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小红提出了判断长度为k的连续子数组是否为‘好数组’的问题，因此直接关联该事件的定义和求解目标。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小红定义了'好数组'的标准，而'长度为k的连续子数组'是该标准的应用对象，用于计算满足条件的子数组数量。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-6ce68f09c9880a806fa77fc9e0353747&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f7f29f281e82943a6275eeb375551e96&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-530995d49951c45e98e86815187d220e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c7b71846906cd22045a6e706147e16a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba72db828b431d38fb8b921bf2efe8f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-027c233ef61ff361ee05722f5ed26bb4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-024e6660a409c2c9cff7e5ce68df8141&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-298f45a7c550505ab780a7272f419093&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ce786094a91232deb40314c19c44bd5</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;小红&quot;" target="&quot;回文数组&quot;">
      <data key="d3">50.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"小红定义了'回文数组'作为判断'好数组'的必要条件，因此是该概念的创建者和核心依据。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小红明确定义了回文数组的概念，作为判断'好数组'的基础标准。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小红定义了'好数组'的前提条件，即数组不能是回文数组，但修改一个元素后必须成为回文数组，因此回文数组是其概念体系的核心。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小红明确定义了'回文数组'的概念，并将其作为'好数组'判定的组成部分，是该事件的核心定义者。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小红明确定义了'回文数组'的概念作为'好数组'判断的基础，是概念提出者与被定义对象的关系。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-3c7b71846906cd22045a6e706147e16a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f7f29f281e82943a6275eeb375551e96&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba72db828b431d38fb8b921bf2efe8f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-027c233ef61ff361ee05722f5ed26bb4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-298f45a7c550505ab780a7272f419093</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;小红&quot;" target="&quot;学生程序&quot;">
      <data key="d3">47.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"小红提出的问题被学生程序尝试解答，学生程序是针对小红定义的'好数组'问题的具体实现，二者构成问题与解法的直接关系。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小红提出的问题被学生程序试图解决，但程序逻辑错误（如循环边界、计数范围）导致输出结果不正确，表明学生对问题理解存在偏差。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小红提出的问题被学生通过程序实现，学生程序是对小红定义的'好数组'概念的算法实现尝试。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小红提出的问题被学生程序试图解决，但程序存在逻辑错误，表明学生对问题理解或实现存在偏差。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小红是学生程序的使用者或评估对象，该程序是为响应小红的请求而编写的，但存在错误未能满足其要求。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小红设计的问题被学生程序尝试解决，学生程序是其问题的实现载体。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-3c7b71846906cd22045a6e706147e16a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f7f29f281e82943a6275eeb375551e96&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d74a7035ea593ebcd1810f6bb2b195f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-52330c48254eb28040891fc6658900e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-024e6660a409c2c9cff7e5ce68df8141&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ce786094a91232deb40314c19c44bd5</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;小红&quot;" target="&quot;修改恰好一个元素&quot;">
      <data key="d3">20.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"小红将'修改恰好一个元素'作为'好数组'的必要条件之一，是规则制定者与核心操作的关系。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小红提出的第二个条件'修改恰好一个元素'是定义'好数组'的核心逻辑之一。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-ba72db828b431d38fb8b921bf2efe8f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-027c233ef61ff361ee05722f5ed26bb4</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;小红&quot;" target="&quot;STUDENT PROGRAM&quot;">
      <data key="d3">234.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"小红 is the problem designer whose requirements the student program attempts to satisfy; the program's errors indicate a misunderstanding of the required transformation rules."&lt;SEP&gt;The "STUDENT PROGRAM" is a direct attempted solution to the problem formally defined and designed by 小红, who acts as the problem setter and authority in this context. 小红 explicitly articulated the transformation task centered on achieving a “好矩阵” (or “好数组”), specifying the logical conditions and rules that define valid matrix transformations—particularly through a sequence of permitted swap operations. The program was developed by a student with the explicit goal of implementing 小红’s defined requirements, establishing a clear requester-developer relationship: 小红 as the problem designer, and the student as the solver tasked with realizing her specifications.

Despite its clear objective, the "STUDENT PROGRAM" contains logical errors that prevent it from correctly executing the transformation rules as defined by 小红. These errors indicate a mismatch between the intended conditions for a “好矩阵” and the actual implementation logic within the C++ code, resulting in outputs that fail to satisfy 小红’s specified criteria. Consequently, while the program is a direct and intentional response to 小红’s problem—designed to fulfill her transformation task—it ultimately falls short due to implementation flaws, demonstrating a deficiency in either the student’s understanding of the problem or the accuracy of the code’s logic. Thus, the "STUDENT PROGRAM" remains an incomplete and unsuccessful attempt to realize 小红’s well-defined problem specification.&lt;SEP&gt;"小红 poses the problem that the student program attempts to solve; the program is a direct attempt to implement the required transformation logic as defined by 小红."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红 poses the problem that the Student Program attempts to solve; the program is a direct implementation attempt by a student responding to her defined challenge."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红's problem is being solved by the student's program, which attempts to implement the required adjacent-swap transformation logic."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-db8545487dac8cc471629adfdae25139&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ce68f09c9880a806fa77fc9e0353747&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa0781f7cefac10e68ae2462b8b87c96&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bdb8ee034f3f855cc75e56f09fb5d38e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44413f301feabb11269b4dc39c5222e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63ae00dd7b87111567e7a60bf8a5b446&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f38a167365a5d0276ffb59f1c81ca944&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f4fbb8a3d02558286f8c4e5541d666a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3527463f6698513f73f0ea87456339d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ede3f2ca6120cc400df50c87dd9d424e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-217fe638fecef3a44e899922c26436a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b114d72fb1df4b15a6815afb987ada0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-298f45a7c550505ab780a7272f419093&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-863e6c43b922d66931de72f56a647cc3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd3265a331ceecdcaa4effe7d518de46&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-57aa2fab03045a4f1a94b22bda9b2d8c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a6025949968addfd629ffba156975574&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c230135cc0686d17fd15b2cc48624237&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-149cbf20a38db662126124752f186e78&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8aa247fbd5005d5da8b7a8cde9c6045&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a57838963dbbc9472322e841bbb48518&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1bb26b30f621e23f24679fbe24e9ff02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d0569105254caf9ef1ed75024750e2dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bf97b3ffe5b076b009e7bd3766ab5ff8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-751de14de4f6fd0795902684f69fa4d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34f50176f8b78d245242c999fcfe00f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7545db3cc1ccecefc971d68863f9d5d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6498d4b9b73c6042d086d98534de214&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-17db13cfc936b3b0723f1bccf5ab9e2b</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;小红&quot;" target="&quot;C++&quot;">
      <data key="d3">6.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"小红提出的问题被学生使用C++语言实现，C++是承载问题解决方案的技术媒介。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-530995d49951c45e98e86815187d220e</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;小红&quot;" target="&quot;行列式构造问题&quot;">
      <data key="d3">54.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"小红是提出行列式构造问题的主体，该事件由她发起并作为学习任务呈现。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小红是行列式构造问题的提出者，该问题由她发起并要求他人解决。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小红是该行列式构造问题的提出者，她希望他人帮助解决这一数学编程任务。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小红是该行列式构造问题的提出者，她要求构造满足特定数学条件的3阶行列式。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小红是该行列式构造问题的提出者，她期望他人完成这一数学编程任务。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小红是行列式构造问题的提出者，她要求构造满足特定数学条件的3阶行列式。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-a30f9ec7408ca06b7c771fc97561f645&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aac5d5d59a7a70f797da35494e4d2445&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f60feb161c47a7bafa53243ce4b63a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-02e36ca7c8f7333f04a1da83fdfca6d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67c8a9f3dbca6c60977a232482cbd794&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-832d0fd3bfe40bdf1afad5dcc2270ef7</data>
