    <edge source="&quot;小红&quot;" target="&quot;ENUMERATION_AND_SORTING&quot;">
      <data key="d3">105.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"To transform the matrix efficiently, one must enumerate the positions of all '1's and sort or route them to the top-left quadrant, indicating Enumeration_and_Sorting is a foundational technique for the solution."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红's problem involves identifying and repositioning all '1's to the top-left quadrant, which necessitates enumeration of their current positions and sorting them into target locations."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红's solution uses sorting, indicating she applies enumeration and sorting to analyze the array, but fails to correctly model the effect of doubling on min/max after sorting."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红提出的排列构造问题 inherently requires enumeration of possible assignments and sorting of intervals to apply an efficient solution, making this knowledge point central to solving the problem."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红设计的问题需要通过排序和枚举候选值来 find optimal target elements, and the student correctly applies sorting as the foundational step, showing alignment with the problem's intended solution strategy."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红设计的问题要求通过排序来高效找到最优配对，学生程序正确使用了std::sort，表明理解了排序在解题中的关键作用。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小红设计的问题需要通过排序和枚举可能的元素配对来求解最小操作次数，该知识点是解决问题的核心方法之一。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小红's problem necessitates identifying and ordering all '1' positions to relocate them efficiently, which relies on enumeration and sorting of coordinates."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红's problem necessitates enumerating the positions of '1's and sorting their target placements in the top-left quadrant to minimize operations, indicating reliance on enumeration and sorting logic."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红's problem demands enumeration of all misplaced elements and sorting their target positions to guide swap sequences, indicating Enumeration_and_Sorting is essential for an efficient solution."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红’s problem requires identifying and repositioning all '1's to the top-left quadrant, which involves enumerating their current positions and sorting or arranging them into the correct target locations."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红的问题 implicitly requires enumerating the positions of all '1's and sorting/moving them to the top-left quadrant, which is a core aspect of the solution strategy."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红's problem implicitly demands enumeration of misplaced '1's and sorting of swap operations to achieve the target efficiently within the step limit."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-6e4ddc2f7b93043f925591323e0cf949&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-99207f6dd7e45092a4cdbb095f26b994&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-81b34a546caa05527bcea45d142d3a12&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b0d1d95f57ac4a2069ff146ad2eb612&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3322c36325d08c143197c29a7781bd1b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-213863e034cdfa89c3209c59cdabf9c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-085095cde15602fbbadf4f1eb221b4d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-43a065cc265cc5e7c843684d7a8f2e30&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9c70453a05eddbb7fbeb8e33aece214f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb266f676f817ae1da7faf5ef3318979&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f0f2b547eda9d3f79f6f93c01a68c2d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d4c87648c8f1869fb042a3290df6eeb3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-13ec9ea4c664af3656c0682232565f07</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;小红&quot;" target="&quot;GREEDY&quot;">
      <data key="d3">101.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The constraint of minimizing swap operations implies a greedy approach—each '1' is moved directly toward its target position in the top-left quadrant with the fewest steps, a hallmark of greedy strategy."&lt;SEP&gt;"The problem is designed to be solved using a greedy algorithm that assigns smallest feasible values in sorted order, which is the intended solution approach."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红 attempts a greedy-like formula (min of two cases) to choose the best outcome, but misunderstands how doubling affects global min/max, showing flawed greedy reasoning."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红的问题 implicitly requires a greedy choice of median values to minimize operations, and the student's approach of selecting median candidates and computing absolute differences reflects correct application of greedy principles."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红的问题本质上鼓励贪心策略：排序后将前半部分元素变换为一个值，后半部分变换为另一个值。学生尝试通过中位数优化成本，但逻辑错误导致失败，表明部分理解但应用不当。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小红的问题隐含贪心策略：选择中位数作为目标值以最小化绝对差之和，这是最优解的关键，学生尝试但错误实现该策略。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小红's problem implicitly demands a greedy strategy: moving each '1' directly toward its target position in the top-left quadrant with the fewest possible swaps, avoiding unnecessary moves."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红's solution strategy must use a greedy approach—each swap should directly reduce the distance of a '1' to its target, ensuring optimality within the operation limit."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红's problem implies a greedy approach: moving each '1' directly toward its target position in the top-left quadrant with the fewest adjacent swaps, without backtracking."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红's constraint on maximum operations (n³/2) implies a greedy strategy is expected—each '1' is moved directly toward its target in the top-left quadrant with minimal steps, without exhaustive search."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红’s constraint of minimizing swap operations and the guarantee of a solution within n³/2 steps implies a greedy strategy of moving each '1' directly toward its target with minimal steps."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红's problem expects a greedy strategy—moving each '1' directly to its target position with minimal steps—since the solution must be efficient and within the n³/2 operation bound."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-6e4ddc2f7b93043f925591323e0cf949&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-99207f6dd7e45092a4cdbb095f26b994&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-81b34a546caa05527bcea45d142d3a12&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b0d1d95f57ac4a2069ff146ad2eb612&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3322c36325d08c143197c29a7781bd1b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-213863e034cdfa89c3209c59cdabf9c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-085095cde15602fbbadf4f1eb221b4d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-43a065cc265cc5e7c843684d7a8f2e30&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9c70453a05eddbb7fbeb8e33aece214f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb266f676f817ae1da7faf5ef3318979&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f0f2b547eda9d3f79f6f93c01a68c2d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-13ec9ea4c664af3656c0682232565f07</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;小红&quot;" target="&quot;DYNAMIC_PROGRAMMING&quot;">
      <data key="d3">17.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"小红 does not use dynamic programming to explore all subarray doubling options, missing a more robust solution approach that could guarantee optimality."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红的问题不需要动态规划，学生未使用DP，符合问题本质，表明正确判断了问题的最优解法复杂度。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小红的问题理论上可被DP建模（如状态为已选元素集合和目标值），但学生未使用DP，表明其未识别该问题的最优子结构特性。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-9c70453a05eddbb7fbeb8e33aece214f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-13ec9ea4c664af3656c0682232565f07&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f0f2b547eda9d3f79f6f93c01a68c2d6</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;小红&quot;" target="&quot;SIMULATION&quot;">
      <data key="d3">104.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"小红's code does not simulate all possible subarray doublings; instead, it uses a simplified heuristic that leads to incorrect results."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红的问题 involves simulating the cost of increment/decrement operations, and the student's code explicitly computes these costs using std::abs, correctly simulating the transformation process."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红的问题要求模拟元素值的增减操作以达成目标，学生代码中计算绝对差值的过程是对该模拟的正确尝试，但目标值选择错误导致整体失效。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小红的问题要求模拟数组元素的增减操作过程，学生程序通过排序和交换模拟了数组重构过程，但逻辑有误。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小红's problem requires a simulation of adjacent character swaps to achieve the target matrix, making Simulation the central computational technique needed to solve it."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红's problem requires simulating adjacent swaps to transform the matrix, making Simulation the central computational technique needed to achieve the goal."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红's problem requires a simulation-based solution involving step-by-step adjacent swaps, making Simulation the central computational technique needed to achieve the target matrix."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红's problem requires a simulation-based algorithm to model adjacent swaps in the matrix to reach the '好矩阵' state, making Simulation the core computational technique."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红's problem requires a simulation of adjacent swaps to transform the matrix, making Simulation the fundamental computational method needed to solve it."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红设计的问题本质上要求 a simulation of adjacent swaps to reach a target matrix state, making Simulation the central computational technique needed to solve her problem."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红设计的问题要求通过模拟相邻字符交换过程来 transform the matrix, making Simulation the essential computational technique to solve it."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红's problem requires simulation of adjacent swaps to transform the matrix, making Simulation the central computational technique needed to fulfill her defined goal."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-6e4ddc2f7b93043f925591323e0cf949&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-99207f6dd7e45092a4cdbb095f26b994&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-81b34a546caa05527bcea45d142d3a12&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3322c36325d08c143197c29a7781bd1b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-213863e034cdfa89c3209c59cdabf9c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-085095cde15602fbbadf4f1eb221b4d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-43a065cc265cc5e7c843684d7a8f2e30&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9c70453a05eddbb7fbeb8e33aece214f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb266f676f817ae1da7faf5ef3318979&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f0f2b547eda9d3f79f6f93c01a68c2d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d4c87648c8f1869fb042a3290df6eeb3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-13ec9ea4c664af3656c0682232565f07</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;小红&quot;" target="&quot;BINARY_SEARCH&quot;">
      <data key="d3">17.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"小红 does not employ binary search to optimize the doubling choice, indicating lack of awareness of advanced optimization techniques for this problem."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红的问题 could be solved more optimally using binary search on the target value, but the student does not use it, instead enumerating fixed candidates — indicating awareness of the problem’s structure but not full optimization."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红的问题理论上可通过二分查找最优目标值优化，但学生未使用该方法，仅依赖有限候选值，表明对最优解搜索空间的理解不完整。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小红的问题可被二分答案（最小操作数）优化，但学生未使用该方法，说明其未考虑搜索空间优化策略。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-43a065cc265cc5e7c843684d7a8f2e30&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9c70453a05eddbb7fbeb8e33aece214f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-13ec9ea4c664af3656c0682232565f07&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f0f2b547eda9d3f79f6f93c01a68c2d6</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;小红&quot;" target="&quot;INPUT_OUTPUT_AND_SEQUENTIAL_STRUCTURE&quot;">
      <data key="d3">31.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"小红 correctly implements input reading and sequential array processing, showing solid foundational understanding of program structure."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红's problem requires precise sequential processing of input matrix and output of swap operations in order, making Input_Output_and_Sequential_Structure a foundational requirement for correct implementation."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红's problem demands correct input parsing of the matrix and sequential output of swap operations, requiring strict adherence to I/O and sequential processing structure."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红’s problem specification demands precise input parsing and output of swap sequences, which directly maps to the sequential I/O structure implemented in the student’s program."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-6e4ddc2f7b93043f925591323e0cf949&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-81b34a546caa05527bcea45d142d3a12&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-99207f6dd7e45092a4cdbb095f26b994&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f0f2b547eda9d3f79f6f93c01a68c2d6</data>
