    <edge source="&quot;学生程序&quot;" target="&quot;行列式构造问题&quot;">
      <data key="d3">48.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"学生程序是为解决行列式构造问题而编写的代码，试图通过算法计算矩阵元素以满足行列式值等于x的条件。"&lt;SEP&gt;"学生程序是针对行列式构造问题的解决方案尝试，但因逻辑错误未能正确生成满足条件的行列式。"&lt;SEP&gt;"学生程序是针对行列式构造问题的解答尝试，但存在逻辑错误，未能正确生成满足条件的行列式。"&lt;SEP&gt;"学生程序是针对行列式构造问题的解决方案尝试，尽管存在逻辑错误，但其目标是满足问题约束条件。"&lt;SEP&gt;"学生程序是针对行列式构造问题的解决方案尝试，但存在逻辑缺陷，导致无法正确满足题目要求。"&lt;SEP&gt;"学生程序是为解决行列式构造问题而编写的代码，试图通过算法计算矩阵元素以满足行列式等于x的条件。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-a30f9ec7408ca06b7c771fc97561f645&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aac5d5d59a7a70f797da35494e4d2445&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f60feb161c47a7bafa53243ce4b63a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-02e36ca7c8f7333f04a1da83fdfca6d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67c8a9f3dbca6c60977a232482cbd794&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-832d0fd3bfe40bdf1afad5dcc2270ef7</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;学生程序&quot;" target="&quot;A, B, C, D, E&quot;">
      <data key="d3">26.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The student program relies entirely on the variables a, b, c, d, e to construct the determinant, showing they are core components of the implementation."&lt;SEP&gt;"a, b, c, d, e are variables defined within the student program to represent the elements of the 3x3 matrix, forming the core computational structure of the solution."&lt;SEP&gt;"These variables are the core computational components of the student program, directly forming the elements of the 3x3 determinant matrix."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-a30f9ec7408ca06b7c771fc97561f645&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-832d0fd3bfe40bdf1afad5dcc2270ef7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f60feb161c47a7bafa53243ce4b63a5</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;学生程序&quot;" target="&quot;3阶行列式构造&quot;">
      <data key="d3">26.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"学生程序旨在解决3阶行列式构造问题，通过代码逻辑尝试满足约束条件，是该事件的实现尝试。"&lt;SEP&gt;"学生程序旨在解决3阶行列式构造问题，通过算法生成满足条件的矩阵，但因逻辑错误未能正确实现。"&lt;SEP&gt;"学生程序试图解决3阶行列式构造问题，但程序内容完全无关，处理的是字符串计数而非矩阵运算，显示对问题理解严重偏差。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-d74a7035ea593ebcd1810f6bb2b195f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2e0365973dbe3e0ef938639fb89aeca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ac86fcc896b138b33b839c9f998527c9</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;学生程序&quot;" target="&quot;X&quot;">
      <data key="d3">17.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The student program takes x as input and attempts to compute matrix elements (especially e) such that the determinant equals x, making x the central constraint of the solution."&lt;SEP&gt;"The student program takes x as input and attempts to compute matrix elements such that the determinant equals x, but contains flawed logic in calculating element e based on x, leading to incorrect outputs."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-d74a7035ea593ebcd1810f6bb2b195f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2e0365973dbe3e0ef938639fb89aeca</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;学生程序&quot;" target="&quot;STD::ABS&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"std::abs is used within the student program to enforce the absolute value constraint on the computed element e, but its logic fails to handle all edge cases correctly."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-67c8a9f3dbca6c60977a232482cbd794</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;学生程序&quot;" target="&quot;3阶行列式构造问题&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"学生程序旨在解决3阶行列式构造问题，但因逻辑错误未能正确计算e的值，导致行列式结果不符合要求。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-2feb44ce4fa5be3b83426e52f78dce0f</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;学生程序&quot;" target="&quot;模拟&quot;">
      <data key="d3">15.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"学生程序错误地采用了模拟方法（字符串字符计数）来解决本应使用线性代数计算的问题，表明其混淆了问题类型。"&lt;SEP&gt;"学生通过逐字符模拟构造字符串，但模拟规则未能满足题目对‘不连续子序列’的约束，说明模拟策略设计不当。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-93f661a79bff9e316801a96e64c29dc7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ac86fcc896b138b33b839c9f998527c9</data>
