      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"C++ is the language used to implement the solution to the mathematical problem, making it the technical medium for solving the event."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-779b6394c3bf1e24a845e4dbfebf7904</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A[M]&quot;" target="&quot;STUDENT PROGRAM&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The array a[M] stores the input data in the student program and is the primary data structure used to evaluate subarrays for the palindrome condition."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-298f45a7c550505ab780a7272f419093</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A[M]&quot;" target="&quot;N&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The array a[M] is populated with n elements from input, making n the effective size of the data stored in a[M]."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-298f45a7c550505ab780a7272f419093</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A[M]&quot;" target="&quot;T&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"T is the struct type used to instantiate elements stored in array a[M], establishing a direct data structure relationship."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-9370e77c81695b75e64c05cc0a3d5901</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A[M]&quot;" target="&quot;STD::SORT&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"a[M] is sorted using std::sort to enable the greedy assignment strategy, making sorting essential to the algorithm's design."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-9370e77c81695b75e64c05cc0a3d5901</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;N&quot;" target="&quot;K&quot;">
      <data key="d3">19.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"k is the loop variable iterating from 1 to n, directly dependent on the matrix size n for boundary conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"n and k are input parameters where k must be ≤ n for the problem to be valid, establishing a dependency in the problem constraints."&lt;SEP&gt;"n和k共同决定可检查的子数组总数（n - k + 1），是问题规模的基础参数。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-7cf7f0bfd527dd66d9327c11fa6b3ebc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-298f45a7c550505ab780a7272f419093&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-027c233ef61ff361ee05722f5ed26bb4</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;N&quot;" target="&quot;STUDENT PROGRAM&quot;">
      <data key="d3">15.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The variable n is an input to the student program that determines the size of the array being processed, directly influencing the loop bounds."&lt;SEP&gt;"n is the input string length that the Student Program attempts to generate, but the program incorrectly returns ‘NO’ for valid cases (e.g., when n - m &gt; 26) and fails to construct strings properly for other cases."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-298f45a7c550505ab780a7272f419093&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fc7bcf65aa4562f02e59c3d8969ea961</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;N&quot;" target="&quot;井然有序之窗&quot;">
      <data key="d3">15.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"井然有序之窗 is defined for a specific n, making n a critical dimensional parameter of the event."&lt;SEP&gt;"井然有序之窗 is the thematic title for the problem requiring a permutation of length n, symbolizing order under constraints."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-9370e77c81695b75e64c05cc0a3d5901&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-522813e50d2e43c2f3a90462ea89a27d</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;N&quot;" target="&quot;中国&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"n is a standard parameter in Chinese programming competition problems, reflecting the typical problem structure in China."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-9370e77c81695b75e64c05cc0a3d5901</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;N&quot;" target="&quot;1 \SIM N&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"n defines the upper bound of the integer set 1~n, which must be used exactly once in any valid permutation."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-522813e50d2e43c2f3a90462ea89a27d</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;N&quot;" target="&quot;小苯&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"小苯 is given an array of size n and must process all pairs within this size constraint to solve the problem."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-0912d8b8a7e5a597e50db3ea5336268a</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;N&quot;" target="&quot;M&quot;">
      <data key="d3">53.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"n and m are array dimensions that define the bounds for loops and array access; their mismatch or misuse in diagonal traversal leads to logical errors."&lt;SEP&gt;"n and m define the dimensions of the grid, jointly determining the size and bounds of the graph structure for traversal."&lt;SEP&gt;"n 和 m 是输入参数，n 为字符串长度，m 为期望可爱度，二者关系决定是否存在合法字符串（如 n ≤ m 时无解）。"&lt;SEP&gt;"n 和 m 是成对输入参数，题目要求判断是否存在长度为 n 且可爱度为 m 的字符串，二者在逻辑上直接关联。"&lt;SEP&gt;"n和m构成问题的输入-输出对，目标是判断是否存在操作序列将n转化为m。"&lt;SEP&gt;"n and m are the start and end states in the numerical transformation problem; the goal is to determine if a sequence of operations can transform n into m, making them directly related as source and target in the state transition system."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-a4117c59b410de1711656865bd10cb59&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ccb9086dce37a69e62b6fe93d738da78&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d2d96c31e95bd2cc22d83070842cc3b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d2076568b2623a983fd25582f3fa50c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2c278038d1b5c766243692d5b0c40bf8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fc7bcf65aa4562f02e59c3d8969ea961</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;N&quot;" target="&quot;字符串外串&quot;">
      <data key="d3">15.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"n 作为字符串长度的输入参数，是‘字符串外串’事件中判断是否存在合法字符串的关键约束条件。"&lt;SEP&gt;"n 作为输入参数，决定了‘字符串外串’事件中字符串的长度约束，是问题可解性的关键输入。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-d2076568b2623a983fd25582f3fa50c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fc7bcf65aa4562f02e59c3d8969ea961</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;N&quot;" target="&quot;牛可乐&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"牛可乐 defines n as a key input parameter for constructing the string t, establishing the problem's constraints."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-113dd897ceb7d892e27e4255ac1852cd</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;N&quot;" target="&quot;T&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"n determines the exact length of the string t that must be constructed, making n a direct constraint on t."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-113dd897ceb7d892e27e4255ac1852cd</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;N&quot;" target="&quot;STRING T&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"n determines the exact length of string t, directly constraining the solution space for achieving loveliness m."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-9b7fdb13d220397bc7332d07c7cfc57e</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;N&quot;" target="&quot;GRID MAP&quot;">
      <data key="d3">33.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"n defines the number of rows in the Grid Map, establishing its vertical dimension."&lt;SEP&gt;"n defines the vertical extent of the grid map, constraining the valid row indices for Dragon's Breath activation."&lt;SEP&gt;"n defines the number of rows in the grid map, directly determining its vertical size and the range of valid i coordinates."&lt;SEP&gt;"n defines the number of rows in the Grid Map, establishing its vertical size and constraints for Dragon's Breath propagation."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-30fcdbc4a46340504623e14c8b57c676&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-411bbe91994001030c7a545311f4d2a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ab3ebf5f1287dbbf9a2ec35fad95eea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89dd6bd1e7fef4152822627f117d0a69</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;N&quot;" target="&quot;VAL(A)&quot;">
      <data key="d3">32.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"n determines the length of the sequence, which directly affects the number of terms in the sum defining val(a)."&lt;SEP&gt;"n determines the number of terms in the sum defining val(a), making it a structural parameter of the event."&lt;SEP&gt;"val(a) is defined as a sum over n-1 consecutive pairs, so the value of n directly determines the number of terms in the sum and thus the scale of val(a)."&lt;SEP&gt;"val(a) is a summation over n-1 consecutive pairs, making n the structural determinant of the number of terms in the value function."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-b596842b3f70ab70e198d8ac72878311&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f7b2af6a814bb455302a627bfc1141e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20a84c0c02b3b7d3ef7caf0684c1b178&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-293da72110035eed70da0f418dfa1a2b</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;N&quot;" target="&quot;ABSOLUTE EXPECTATION&quot;">
      <data key="d3">15.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"n is a critical geometric parameter in the Absolute Expectation problem, defining the dimensionality of the sequence whose expected absolute difference is being calculated."&lt;SEP&gt;"n is the dimensional parameter that defines the scope of the sequence in the Absolute Expectation problem, directly influencing the computation of expected value."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-b596842b3f70ab70e198d8ac72878311&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20a84c0c02b3b7d3ef7caf0684c1b178</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;N&quot;" target="&quot;A_I&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"n defines the total number of elements in the sequence, directly determining the indices and count of a_i variables from a_1 to a_n."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-b596842b3f70ab70e198d8ac72878311</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;N&quot;" target="&quot;小L&quot;">
      <data key="d3">17.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"小L starts with the number n as the initial state and must transform it using allowed operations to reach m, establishing n as the origin point of the transformation journey."&lt;SEP&gt;"小L获得数字n作为运算起点，n是其操作的输入对象。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-2643532bc65acd10b75f38bdb35830ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-94a277024978e1e9676408dfab4dc3fb</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;N&quot;" target="&quot;小L的数学题&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"n是小L数学题的输入起点，是问题求解的核心初始条件。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-ccb9086dce37a69e62b6fe93d738da78</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;N&quot;" target="&quot;乘以2&quot;">
      <data key="d3">17.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The operation 乘以2 can be applied to n to generate new states (2n, 4n, etc.), forming the forward expansion branch in the state-space graph."&lt;SEP&gt;"n作为初始值，可通过乘以2操作生成新的状态，是操作的起点。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-ccb9086dce37a69e62b6fe93d738da78&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-94a277024978e1e9676408dfab4dc3fb</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;N&quot;" target="&quot;开平方后下取整&quot;">
      <data key="d3">15.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The operation 开平方后下取整 can be applied to n to reduce its value, creating the downward branch in the state-space exploration, potentially leading toward m."&lt;SEP&gt;"n作为初始值，若为完全平方数，可通过开平方后下取整操作生成新状态。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-ccb9086dce37a69e62b6fe93d738da78&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-94a277024978e1e9676408dfab4dc3fb</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;N&quot;" target="&quot;平方和开方运算&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"n is the initial input to the square and square root operations, which are applied iteratively to attempt to reach m, making n the origin of the operational process."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-2c278038d1b5c766243692d5b0c40bf8</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;N&quot;" target="&quot;A&quot;">
      <data key="d3">15.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"n defines the length of binary number a, determining the number of bits that can be flipped or swapped in a."&lt;SEP&gt;"n定义了二进制数a的长度，决定了a中可操作的位数总量。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-2e96fe33a652d98236ab6e39e9022dc7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c558efa82eea3b35fae76cbadb1eff6</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;N&quot;" target="&quot;B&quot;">
      <data key="d3">15.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"n defines the length of binary number b, determining the number of bits that can be flipped or swapped in b."&lt;SEP&gt;"n定义了二进制数b的长度，决定了b中可操作的位数总量。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-2e96fe33a652d98236ab6e39e9022dc7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c558efa82eea3b35fae76cbadb1eff6</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;N&quot;" target="&quot;C&quot;">
      <data key="d3">15.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"n defines the length of binary number c, ensuring all three numbers are of equal bit-width for the XOR operation to be valid."&lt;SEP&gt;"n定义了二进制数c的长度，决定了目标结果的位数规模。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-2e96fe33a652d98236ab6e39e9022dc7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c558efa82eea3b35fae76cbadb1eff6</data>
