      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The variable k defines the fixed window size for subarrays in the student program and is critical to the sliding window logic for counting '好数组'."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-298f45a7c550505ab780a7272f419093</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ANS&quot;" target="&quot;STUDENT PROGRAM&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The variable ans is the output accumulator in the student program, representing the final count of '好数组' as required by the problem."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-298f45a7c550505ab780a7272f419093</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ANS&quot;" target="&quot;A_I XOR A_J&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"ans accumulates the total number of valid pairs where a_i xor a_j equals gcd(a_i, a_j), making it the final output derived from evaluating this relationship across the entire array."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-292b69dd280ff7c3c431c909f2fa1f47</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ANS&quot;" target="&quot;MID&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"mid变量用于确定目标值，而ans基于该目标值计算操作次数，二者直接关联，但mid的错误计算导致ans结果错误。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-ce2daaa3fa89648dcc0d0bc91f132ea2</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ANS&quot;" target="&quot;MID2&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"mid2是最终选定的目标值，ans的最终值依赖于mid2，但mid2的选取逻辑未考虑双生数组的两种元素约束，导致ans错误。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-ce2daaa3fa89648dcc0d0bc91f132ea2</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ANS&quot;" target="&quot;DRAGON'S BREATH&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The goal of Dragon's Breath is to maximize the value stored in ans, which represents the highest possible damage output."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-89dd6bd1e7fef4152822627f117d0a69</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ANS&quot;" target="&quot;SUM&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"ans is updated using the value of Sum for each center coordinate (i,j), making Sum a direct contributor to the final result."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-89dd6bd1e7fef4152822627f117d0a69</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ANS&quot;" target="&quot;CODE EXECUTION ERROR&quot;">
      <data key="d3">6.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"ans is never assigned a value, indicating the algorithm is incomplete, which contributes to the runtime error by leaving the program's output undefined."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-d2d96c31e95bd2cc22d83070842cc3b9</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ANS&quot;" target="&quot;TMP&quot;">
      <data key="d3">6.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"tmp is computed as -a[i][j] and likely contributes to the calculation of ans, though the full logic is incomplete; suggests a potential optimization or subtraction step in the final result."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-a3873516dc37339412e6d863d6c0b47f</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ANS&quot;" target="&quot;INPUT_OUTPUT_AND_SEQUENTIAL_STRUCTURE&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"ans is the output variable whose value is printed, directly embodying the input-output flow of the program."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-64a0b2fc78e14ac24b3790b183153e20</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ANS&quot;" target="&quot;CONTROL_STRUCTURE&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The value of ans is determined entirely by the if-else control structure, making it the dependent output of the program's branching logic."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-64a0b2fc78e14ac24b3790b183153e20</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ANS&quot;" target="&quot;SIMULATION&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"ans is the result of simulating a mathematical process involving counting and weighted arithmetic, making it the simulated outcome of the algorithm."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-64a0b2fc78e14ac24b3790b183153e20</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;L&quot;" target="&quot;R&quot;">
      <data key="d3">16.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"l and r are coupled variables that define the sliding window boundaries; r is always l + k - 1, ensuring consistent subarray length."&lt;SEP&gt;"l和r共同构成滑动窗口的边界，r = l + k - 1，是遍历连续子数组的数学关系。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-027c233ef61ff361ee05722f5ed26bb4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-298f45a7c550505ab780a7272f419093</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;L&quot;" target="&quot;STUDENT PROGRAM&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The variable l is the left boundary of the sliding window in the student program, essential for iterating through all possible subarrays of length k."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-298f45a7c550505ab780a7272f419093</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;L&quot;" target="&quot;ANS[M]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"l is the value assigned to positions in ans[M], directly driving the construction of the output permutation."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-9370e77c81695b75e64c05cc0a3d5901</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;R&quot;" target="&quot;STUDENT PROGRAM&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The variable r is the right boundary of the sliding window, calculated from l and k, and used to check palindrome symmetry in each subarray."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-298f45a7c550505ab780a7272f419093</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;R&quot;" target="&quot;双生数组&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"r表示数组长度，双生数组要求长度为偶数，r是验证和构造双生数组的前提条件。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-ce2daaa3fa89648dcc0d0bc91f132ea2</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;CNT&quot;" target="&quot;STUDENT PROGRAM&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The variable cnt is used in the student program to count mismatches between symmetric elements in a subarray, which determines if it qualifies as a '好数组'."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-298f45a7c550505ab780a7272f419093</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;CNT&quot;" target="&quot;A_I&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Cnt represents the number of unique a_i values after sorting and deduplication, reducing the search space and defining the upper bound for the outer loop that examines each distinct element."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-292b69dd280ff7c3c431c909f2fa1f47</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;CNT&quot;" target="&quot;MIN&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Min is compared against Cnt to determine the branching logic in the if-statement, influencing how ans is calculated."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-64a0b2fc78e14ac24b3790b183153e20</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;CNT&quot;" target="&quot;X&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Cnt is multiplied by x in the else branch and contributes to the weighted sum with x in the if branch, directly scaling the result."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-64a0b2fc78e14ac24b3790b183153e20</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;CNT&quot;" target="&quot;Y&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The difference (Cnt - Min) is used with y in a division-by-two term, making y a key factor in the secondary component of the calculation."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-64a0b2fc78e14ac24b3790b183153e20</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;CNT&quot;" target="&quot;SIMULATION&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The counter cnt is intended to simulate counting valid rows/columns, but its logic is broken due to incorrect flag handling, undermining the simulation."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-ea00e0f2c81dc0fc8cf34f9d8c29edd8</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;CNT&quot;" target="&quot;F&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The flag f is used to control whether cnt is incremented; due to improper resetting of f, cnt is incorrectly counted."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-7cf7f0bfd527dd66d9327c11fa6b3ebc</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;中国&quot;" target="&quot;行列式构造问题&quot;">
      <data key="d3">21.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"行列式构造问题以中文呈现，符合中国数学与编程教育的典型题型风格。"&lt;SEP&gt;"行列式构造问题以中文呈现，符合中国数学与编程教育的典型题型，表明其在中国教育语境中发生。"&lt;SEP&gt;"行列式构造问题出现在中国教育或编程竞赛语境中，使用中文表述，符合中国课程体系中的数学与编程综合题型。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-832d0fd3bfe40bdf1afad5dcc2270ef7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aac5d5d59a7a70f797da35494e4d2445&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67c8a9f3dbca6c60977a232482cbd794</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;中国&quot;" target="&quot;X&quot;">
