    <edge source="&quot;中国&quot;" target="&quot;ENUMERATION_AND_SORTING&quot;">
      <data key="d3">60.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Chinese competitive programming frequently uses enumeration and sorting techniques for optimization problems, aligning with the student's approach."&lt;SEP&gt;"Enumeration_and_Sorting is a core topic in Chinese programming education, and its use in this problem reflects the standard curriculum in Chinese algorithmic training."&lt;SEP&gt;"This problem, presented in Chinese and typical of Chinese programming competitions, frequently tests enumeration and sorting as core algorithmic skills."&lt;SEP&gt;"该问题源自中国编程竞赛背景，排序是其标准解法的核心，中国算法教育普遍强调排序在贪心问题中的基础作用。"&lt;SEP&gt;"In Chinese programming competitions, Enumeration_and_Sorting is a standard technique taught for solving structured grid problems like this one."&lt;SEP&gt;"中国算法教育 emphasizes enumeration and sorting as foundational skills, which aligns with the structured approach needed to solve this '好矩阵' problem in national competitions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Enumeration and sorting problems are staples in Chinese programming education, and this problem’s structure aligns with typical contest-style challenges from this region."&lt;SEP&gt;"Chinese programming contests frequently test Enumeration_and_Sorting techniques in grid-based problems like this one, making it a standard expected skill in this geographic-educational context."&lt;SEP&gt;"Chinese programming contests frequently use enumeration and sorting techniques for grid and array optimization problems, aligning this problem with regional educational patterns."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-6e4ddc2f7b93043f925591323e0cf949&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-81b34a546caa05527bcea45d142d3a12&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b0d1d95f57ac4a2069ff146ad2eb612&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-13ec9ea4c664af3656c0682232565f07&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f665337d67097145c49cecab1e3e3e6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-213863e034cdfa89c3209c59cdabf9c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f0f2b547eda9d3f79f6f93c01a68c2d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d4c87648c8f1869fb042a3290df6eeb3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3527463f6698513f73f0ea87456339d5</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;中国&quot;" target="&quot;GREEDY&quot;">
      <data key="d3">42.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Chinese competitive programming curricula emphasize Greedy strategies for optimization problems with constraints, such as the n³/2 operation limit in this problem."&lt;SEP&gt;"Greedy algorithms are a staple in Chinese algorithmic education and contests, and this problem is a standard example used to assess student mastery."&lt;SEP&gt;"Greedy algorithms are heavily emphasized in Chinese competitive programming, making this knowledge point highly relevant to the problem's context."&lt;SEP&gt;"中国编程竞赛常设计此类贪心优化题，学生尝试使用中位数策略，符合中国算法训练中常见的贪心思维模式，但实现错误。"&lt;SEP&gt;"中国竞赛 problems often favor greedy solutions for optimization tasks like this, making Greedy a commonly taught and expected strategy in this region."&lt;SEP&gt;"Greedy algorithms are frequently tested in Chinese programming competitions, and this problem’s optimal swap strategy reflects that pedagogical focus."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-6e4ddc2f7b93043f925591323e0cf949&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-81b34a546caa05527bcea45d142d3a12&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b0d1d95f57ac4a2069ff146ad2eb612&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-213863e034cdfa89c3209c59cdabf9c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f0f2b547eda9d3f79f6f93c01a68c2d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-13ec9ea4c664af3656c0682232565f07</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
