      <data key="d4">"Dynamic Programming is a staple in Chinese coding competitions, and its absence in the student's solution highlights a gap in advanced technique application."&lt;SEP&gt;"中国编程题中，DP常被误用，但本题学生未使用，说明其正确识别了问题无需DP，符合中国教学中对问题分类的训练成果。"</data>
