    <edge source="&quot;中国&quot;" target="&quot;SIMULATION&quot;">
      <data key="d3">38.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The problem is embedded in Chinese algorithmic competition culture, where Simulation problems are common and require precise step-by-step implementation under strict constraints, reflecting regional pedagogical emphasis."&lt;SEP&gt;"The problem, originating from a Chinese educational context, uses Simulation as the fundamental computational method taught in competitive programming to solve grid-based transformation tasks."&lt;SEP&gt;"中国编程题常要求学生模拟操作过程，学生代码中的差值累加体现了对模拟思维的掌握，尽管目标选择错误。"&lt;SEP&gt;"中国编程竞赛文化 frequently uses simulation problems like this one to test algorithmic thinking, embedding Simulation as a core pedagogical technique in this geographic context."&lt;SEP&gt;"The problem’s origin in Chinese algorithmic competition culture reflects a common emphasis on simulation-based problems in contests like NOI or ICPC."&lt;SEP&gt;"The problem’s origin in China’s algorithmic competition culture emphasizes simulation-based problems as standard training, making Simulation a culturally embedded knowledge point in this context."</data>
