    <edge source="&quot;中国&quot;" target="&quot;《小鸡的排列构造》&quot;">
      <data key="d3">44.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The problem’s language, structure, and naming convention (e.g., ‘小鸡’) are characteristic of Chinese programming contest problem sets, such as those from NOI or Codeforces Chinese rounds."&lt;SEP&gt;"《小鸡的排列构造》是中文语境下典型的算法竞赛题目，符合中国编程竞赛的出题风格和背景。"&lt;SEP&gt;"《小鸡的排列构造》is a Chinese programming competition problem, written in Chinese and following the style of Chinese OI contests."&lt;SEP&gt;"《小鸡的排列构造》is a Chinese-language algorithmic problem with naming and structure typical of Chinese competitive programming contests (e.g., NOI, ICPC regional), indicating its origin in China’s OI ecosystem."&lt;SEP&gt;"该题目使用中文表述、符合中国信息学竞赛风格，表明其源于中国编程教育或竞赛体系。"</data>
