    <edge source="&quot;STUDENT PROGRAM&quot;" target="&quot;STRING_ALGORITHMS&quot;">
      <data key="d3">51.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The Student Program applies string construction logic to satisfy the substring and subsequence equality condition, though the algorithm is incomplete or incorrect for edge cases."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Student Program attempts to apply string algorithms to construct a valid string, but incorrectly handles the non-contiguous subsequence definition, showing a fundamental misunderstanding of the required algorithm."&lt;SEP&gt;"The student attempts to construct a string satisfying substring-subsequence equality, but fails to correctly implement the non-consecutive subsequence constraint as defined, showing flawed understanding of string algorithm design."&lt;SEP&gt;"The student attempts string algorithm construction but misapplies the definition of non-contiguous subsequence (requiring at least two non-adjacent segments), leading to invalid string patterns."&lt;SEP&gt;"The student's program fails to correctly implement string algorithms needed to identify matching substrings and non-consecutive subsequences, indicating a gap in understanding."&lt;SEP&gt;"The student’s solution fails to correctly handle the core string algorithm requirement—matching a substring with a non-contiguous subsequence—indicating a fundamental misunderstanding."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Student Program attempts to construct a string satisfying the subsequence and substring condition, but fails to correctly enforce the ‘at least two non-adjacent segments’ requirement for non-consecutive subsequences, revealing a gap in string algorithm understanding."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Student Program likely fails to correctly implement String_Algorithms needed to handle the novel non-contiguous subsequence definition, leading to the error."&lt;SEP&gt;"The student attempts to construct a string based on substring and subsequence constraints but fails to correctly implement the required non-adjacent subsequence structure, demonstrating a fundamental misunderstanding of the core string algorithm."</data>
