      <data key="d4">"牛可乐 defined the problem that the student program attempts to solve, making the student’s code a direct implementation attempt of牛可乐’s challenge. The program’s errors reflect a misunderstanding of the defined concept of 'beauty'."&lt;SEP&gt;"牛可乐 designed the problem that the student attempted to solve via their C++ program, which contains logical errors in implementation."&lt;SEP&gt;"牛可乐 is the problem author whose definition of 可爱度 the student program attempts to implement, but fails due to logical errors in construction and validation."&lt;SEP&gt;"牛可乐 is the problem author, and the Student Program is an attempt to solve the problem defined by 牛可乐. The program's errors reflect a misunderstanding of the problem's requirements as defined by 牛可乐."&lt;SEP&gt;"牛可乐 proposed the problem that the student program attempts to solve; the program is a direct implementation attempt of the problem's requirements, though flawed."&lt;SEP&gt;"牛可乐 designed the problem that the student attempted to solve via their submitted C++ program, which contains logical errors in implementation."&lt;SEP&gt;"牛可乐 is the problem author whose definition of ‘可爱度’ the Student Program attempts to implement, but the implementation contains critical errors that violate the problem constraints."</data>
