      <data key="d3">61.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Enumeration of median candidates and sorting by cost is the mechanism by which the greedy strategy is implemented to select the optimal target value."&lt;SEP&gt;"The correct solution to this problem combines sorting of intervals by right bound (enumeration order) with a greedy assignment strategy — these two knowledge points are interdependent for a valid answer."&lt;SEP&gt;"The student combines sorting with greedy median selection to minimize operations, showing an integrated but incomplete application of both knowledge points."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sorting enables the greedy selection of median values as optimal targets for minimizing absolute differences — the two knowledge points are logically dependent in this problem’s solution."&lt;SEP&gt;"The student combines enumeration of candidate medians with a greedy minimization of absolute differences, but the candidate selection is incorrect, leading to suboptimal greedy choices."&lt;SEP&gt;"排序是实现贪心策略的基础，学生使用排序后试图选取中位数作为目标，但错误计算了中位数和配对方式，导致逻辑断裂。"&lt;SEP&gt;"The student combines enumeration of candidate medians with a greedy selection of the one minimizing total absolute differences, a common heuristic in optimization problems."</data>
