      <data key="d4">"小苯 attempts to solve the problem using enumeration (nested loops) and sorting of unique values, but misapplies the technique by not preserving original indices or validating pair existence, indicating flawed understanding of enumeration under constraints."&lt;SEP&gt;"小苯's solution relies on sorting and enumerating divisors to find valid pairs, but misapplies the enumeration logic, leading to incorrect results."&lt;SEP&gt;"小苯 implements enumeration via nested loops and sorting of the array to systematically check pairs and avoid duplicates, indicating direct application of these knowledge points."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-c0621f867e87fb25088a534465259d65&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff32fffb52415ec4221990a56352b068&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d78f2079f220a0196b9a21caa622db85</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
