    <edge source="&quot;ENUMERATION_AND_SORTING&quot;" target="&quot;双生数组&quot;">
      <data key="d3">26.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The problem requires enumerating possible element pairs and sorting the array to efficiently pair elements for equal frequency — core to achieving the '双生数组' state."&lt;SEP&gt;"The student enumerates candidate median values and sorts them by cost to greedily pick the best one, which is a key step toward achieving the '双生数组' target."&lt;SEP&gt;"双生数组的构造依赖于元素的有序分布，排序是确定两种目标值并最小化变换成本的必要步骤，是达成该事件的核心技术前提。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-4f665337d67097145c49cecab1e3e3e6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0ba89973533fbfc1f9082a792c162c21&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-13ec9ea4c664af3656c0682232565f07</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ENUMERATION_AND_SORTING&quot;" target="&quot;好矩阵&quot;">
      <data key="d3">143.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Enumeration_and_Sorting enables the identification and reordering of '1' elements to their precise locations in the left-upper quadrant of '好矩阵', ensuring the target structure is met."&lt;SEP&gt;"好矩阵’s rigid structure requires enumerating all non-conforming '1's and sorting them into the top-left quadrant, defining the goal of the enumeration and sorting process."&lt;SEP&gt;The entity "ENUMERATION_AND_SORTING" refers to a systematic computational process essential for constructing the "好矩阵" (good matrix), a target matrix structure defined by the strict positional requirement that all occurrences of the value '1' must be relocated to the top-left quadrant of the matrix—specifically, to positions where both row index i and column index j are less than or equal to n/2 (for an n×n matrix). To achieve this configuration, the process begins with the enumeration of all current positions of '1's in the input matrix, ensuring complete identification and accounting for every such element. Following enumeration, these positions are sorted or reordered according to a predefined spatial priority, enabling their precise and efficient relocation into the fixed target region. This reorganization constitutes a form of spatial sorting, where the goal is not to sort values by magnitude but to sort element placements by their destination coordinates within the quadrant. The necessity of enumeration ensures no '1' is overlooked during transformation, while the sorting mechanism guarantees that the final arrangement conforms exactly to the structural logic of the 好矩阵. Although the process is conceptually straightforward, implementations—such as those attempted by students—may fail due to errors in enumeration completeness or sorting logic. Thus, ENUMERATION_AND_SORTING is not merely an algorithmic technique but the foundational operational framework that defines the solution space for achieving the 好矩阵, combining exhaustive identification (enumeration) with ordered repositioning (sorting) to satisfy its rigid positional constraints.&lt;SEP&gt;"To efficiently convert any given matrix into a '好矩阵', one must enumerate the current positions of '1's and sort or map them to the exact target positions in the top-left quadrant, implying Enumeration_and_Sorting is essential for optimality."&lt;SEP&gt;"To construct 好矩阵, one must enumerate all '1's outside the top-left quadrant and sort/sequence their movements logically to minimize swaps."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-6e4ddc2f7b93043f925591323e0cf949&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-99207f6dd7e45092a4cdbb095f26b994&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-81b34a546caa05527bcea45d142d3a12&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd3265a331ceecdcaa4effe7d518de46&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1bb26b30f621e23f24679fbe24e9ff02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d0569105254caf9ef1ed75024750e2dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3322c36325d08c143197c29a7781bd1b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-213863e034cdfa89c3209c59cdabf9c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a6025949968addfd629ffba156975574&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7545db3cc1ccecefc971d68863f9d5d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6498d4b9b73c6042d086d98534de214&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-085095cde15602fbbadf4f1eb221b4d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8aa247fbd5005d5da8b7a8cde9c6045&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ede3f2ca6120cc400df50c87dd9d424e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb266f676f817ae1da7faf5ef3318979&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3527463f6698513f73f0ea87456339d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d4c87648c8f1869fb042a3290df6eeb3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-17db13cfc936b3b0723f1bccf5ab9e2b</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
