    <edge source="&quot;SIMULATION&quot;" target="&quot;双生数组&quot;">
      <data key="d3">22.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The code simulates the effect of changing each array element to candidate values, modeling the transformation process to achieve the '双生数组' state."&lt;SEP&gt;"The student simulates the effect of increment/decrement operations by computing absolute differences from candidate targets, attempting to model the transformation process toward the '双生数组' state."&lt;SEP&gt;"双生数组的转换过程本质是模拟每个元素的增减操作，学生代码中的绝对差求和是对该模拟的直接体现，尽管目标值错误。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-4f665337d67097145c49cecab1e3e3e6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0ba89973533fbfc1f9082a792c162c21&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-13ec9ea4c664af3656c0682232565f07</data>
