    <edge source="&quot;SIMULATION&quot;" target="&quot;GREEDY&quot;">
      <data key="d3">49.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The greedy choice of target values is evaluated through simulation of operation costs (sum of absolute differences), making simulation the mechanism by which the greedy strategy is validated."&lt;SEP&gt;"The simulation of operation costs for each candidate is the evaluation step that enables the greedy choice of the minimal-cost median."&lt;SEP&gt;"贪心策略通过模拟元素移动来实现，学生程序模拟了数组重排和差值计算，但因中位数选取错误导致模拟结果无效。"&lt;SEP&gt;"The greedy strategy is implemented via simulation of operations (abs differences) across the array for each candidate, showing an attempt to model the transformation process."&lt;SEP&gt;"The simulation of adjacent swaps in the student program is implemented using a greedy approach—each '1' is moved as soon as possible to the next target location without considering future consequences."&lt;SEP&gt;"The problem requires a greedy simulation approach—moving each '1' directly to its target quadrant position with minimal swaps—and the student's failure suggests a breakdown in this combined strategy."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-4f665337d67097145c49cecab1e3e3e6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44413f301feabb11269b4dc39c5222e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8aa247fbd5005d5da8b7a8cde9c6045&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9c70453a05eddbb7fbeb8e33aece214f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-43a065cc265cc5e7c843684d7a8f2e30&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9df1d2463f063a1f6d5c14e8234cc8f</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;SIMULATION&quot;" target="&quot;HASH&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The problem requires simulating element transformations and counting frequencies of values to identify two target elements — the student fails to use hashing for frequency counting, breaking the simulation's correctness."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-24e64575422fca0e0f51cc22d5cd223d</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;SIMULATION&quot;" target="&quot;好矩阵&quot;">
      <data key="d3">213.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Simulation is the process used to achieve the target state of '好矩阵' by iteratively swapping adjacent elements until the required pattern is formed."&lt;SEP&gt;"好矩阵 is the target state that must be achieved through simulation of adjacent swaps, making Simulation the process by which the target is reached."&lt;SEP&gt;The entity "好矩阵" (good matrix) is defined as a specific target state that must be achieved through the computational process of simulation, specifically by performing a series of adjacent swaps on an arbitrary 01 matrix. The definition of 好矩阵 mandates a strict structural configuration—namely, the repositioning of all '1's into the top-left quadrant of the matrix—through a step-by-step, iterative transformation process. This transformation cannot be accomplished through direct assignment or analytical methods; it requires simulation as the sole viable computational approach. Simulation, in this context, is not merely a tool but the essential procedural method that enables the realization of 好矩阵 by modeling and executing adjacent element swaps until the prescribed target configuration is reached. The correctness of the simulation is directly dependent on its ability to accurately replicate the required pattern of swaps and ultimately achieve the exact structural conditions defined by 好矩阵. Thus, simulation is both the necessary and sufficient process for realizing 好矩阵, with the two entities intrinsically linked: 好矩阵 is the goal, and simulation is the indispensable mechanism for attaining it.&lt;SEP&gt;"The definition of '好矩阵' requires a step-by-step transformation process via adjacent swaps, making Simulation the necessary computational method to achieve the target state."&lt;SEP&gt;"The goal of achieving a '好矩阵' requires simulating step-by-step adjacent swaps to rearrange the matrix into the required pattern."&lt;SEP&gt;"好矩阵 is the target state that can only be reached through a simulated sequence of adjacent character swaps, making Simulation the essential process to achieve it."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-6e4ddc2f7b93043f925591323e0cf949&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa0781f7cefac10e68ae2462b8b87c96&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bdb8ee034f3f855cc75e56f09fb5d38e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb266f676f817ae1da7faf5ef3318979&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3527463f6698513f73f0ea87456339d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d4c87648c8f1869fb042a3290df6eeb3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-213863e034cdfa89c3209c59cdabf9c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ede3f2ca6120cc400df50c87dd9d424e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-863e6c43b922d66931de72f56a647cc3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-99207f6dd7e45092a4cdbb095f26b994&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd3265a331ceecdcaa4effe7d518de46&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-81b34a546caa05527bcea45d142d3a12&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-085095cde15602fbbadf4f1eb221b4d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8aa247fbd5005d5da8b7a8cde9c6045&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a57838963dbbc9472322e841bbb48518&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1bb26b30f621e23f24679fbe24e9ff02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d0569105254caf9ef1ed75024750e2dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3322c36325d08c143197c29a7781bd1b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bf97b3ffe5b076b009e7bd3766ab5ff8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34f50176f8b78d245242c999fcfe00f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7545db3cc1ccecefc971d68863f9d5d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6498d4b9b73c6042d086d98534de214&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-17db13cfc936b3b0723f1bccf5ab9e2b</data>
