      <data key="d3">70.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The '字符串外串' problem is centered on string algorithms involving substring and non-contiguous subsequence matching — the core of the problem. The student's program attempts but fails to correctly implement this."&lt;SEP&gt;"The core of '字符串外串' involves constructing and analyzing substrings and non-contiguous subsequences, which are fundamental topics in string algorithms."&lt;SEP&gt;"‘字符串外串’ is fundamentally a string algorithm problem requiring understanding of substrings and specially defined subsequences."&lt;SEP&gt;"The event '字符串外串' fundamentally relies on string algorithms to identify matching substring and non-contiguous subsequence pairs of maximal length."&lt;SEP&gt;"‘字符串外串’这一事件的核心是字符串算法问题，涉及子串与特殊子序列的匹配判定与构造。"&lt;SEP&gt;"‘字符串外串’ is an algorithmic problem fundamentally rooted in string algorithms involving substring and non-contiguous subsequence matching."&lt;SEP&gt;"字符串外串 as the event encapsulates the challenge of string algorithm design around matching substring and non-consecutive subsequence, which the student’s program attempts but fails to correctly realize."</data>
