      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Chinese competitive programming frequently emphasizes number theory problems involving modular arithmetic, inverses, and large integer handling, which aligns with the student's implementation."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-59c3a5bb9cb5e430b4a6a0cbd5778b07</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
