    <edge source="&quot;GREEDY&quot;" target="&quot;井然有序之窗&quot;">
      <data key="d3">27.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The event '井然有序之窗' represents a classic greedy problem in competitive programming where optimal assignment is achieved by processing intervals in sorted order."&lt;SEP&gt;"‘井然有序之窗’ as the problem event requires a structured solution, and the greedy method is the student’s chosen approach to achieve order within constraints."&lt;SEP&gt;"The optimal solution to '井然有序之窗' relies on a greedy algorithm that prioritizes intervals with smaller right bounds — a core technique for this problem type."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-94bb812737ccf1fcdbc2dc32333a9c59&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b0d1d95f57ac4a2069ff146ad2eb612&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-57aa2fab03045a4f1a94b22bda9b2d8c</data>
