    <edge source="&quot;GREEDY&quot;" target="&quot;双生数组&quot;">
      <data key="d3">31.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The '双生数组' event requires minimizing operations, which motivates the greedy selection of median values to balance element counts."&lt;SEP&gt;"The algorithm uses a greedy strategy to minimize total absolute differences by choosing the median-like value, aiming to reach the '双生数组' state with minimal operations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The student applies a greedy strategy by selecting median values to minimize total operations, aiming to transform the array into a state with two equal-frequency elements — a correct intuition but flawed implementation."&lt;SEP&gt;"达成双生数组的最小操作次数可通过贪心策略实现：将排序后数组的前半与后半分别聚合为两个值，学生尝试了此思路但实现有误。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-4f665337d67097145c49cecab1e3e3e6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0ba89973533fbfc1f9082a792c162c21&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-13ec9ea4c664af3656c0682232565f07</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;GREEDY&quot;" target="&quot;好矩阵&quot;">
      <data key="d3">84.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"A greedy algorithm is the most efficient way to construct the '好矩阵' under the operation limit, by greedily placing each '1' into the top-left quadrant."&lt;SEP&gt;"A greedy approach is logically sound for this problem since each '1' must end in a fixed location; however, the student's greedy implementation is flawed due to incorrect coordinate updates."&lt;SEP&gt;"Achieving 好矩阵 efficiently requires a greedy movement strategy for '1's, ensuring minimal swaps without unnecessary back-and-forth."&lt;SEP&gt;"The construction of '好矩阵' can be achieved greedily by moving each '1' directly toward its target without backtracking, which aligns with the greedy strategy used in the student solution."&lt;SEP&gt;"The optimal solution to form '好矩阵' can be achieved via greedy placement of '1's, as each '1' can be independently moved without conflicting with others in the target zone."&lt;SEP&gt;"好矩阵's deterministic structure allows a greedy approach to be optimal: each '1' should move directly to its target without detours, ensuring minimal operations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The greedy strategy is applied to construct the '好矩阵' by optimally placing each '1' in the top-left quadrant with minimal moves, directly enabling the target event."&lt;SEP&gt;"好矩阵 can be efficiently reached using a greedy strategy that minimizes each '1'’s path to its target, making Greedy the optimal approach for this event."&lt;SEP&gt;"好矩阵’s fixed pattern allows a greedy approach: each '1' outside the top-left quadrant can be moved step-by-step toward its target without backtracking, minimizing total operations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Greedy strategy is applied to efficiently construct '好矩阵' by always moving the nearest '1' to the next available target position in the left-upper quadrant, minimizing total operations."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-6e4ddc2f7b93043f925591323e0cf949&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-99207f6dd7e45092a4cdbb095f26b994&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd3265a331ceecdcaa4effe7d518de46&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-81b34a546caa05527bcea45d142d3a12&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d0569105254caf9ef1ed75024750e2dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3322c36325d08c143197c29a7781bd1b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-213863e034cdfa89c3209c59cdabf9c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6498d4b9b73c6042d086d98534de214&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-085095cde15602fbbadf4f1eb221b4d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb266f676f817ae1da7faf5ef3318979</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
