    <edge source="&quot;ERROR DESCRIPTION&quot;" target="&quot;CONTROL_STRUCTURE&quot;">
      <data key="d3">53.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The error description highlights incorrect use of control structures (if and for loops) with improper flag initialization and scope, leading to wrong logic outcomes."&lt;SEP&gt;"The error description implies the student incorrectly used control structures (if conditions and loops) to evaluate array elements, leading to faulty logic."&lt;SEP&gt;"The student's code uses if-else logic to handle two cases (Min + (Cnt - Min) &amp; 1 and Cnt * x), and the error description indicates incorrect output, suggesting a misunderstanding in conditional branching or operator precedence (e.g., bitwise &amp; vs. logical &amp;&amp;)."&lt;SEP&gt;"The student’s error in flag logic (f = 1 when a[k][3-k+1] &gt; 1) indicates misunderstanding of nested conditionals and loop scope, core aspects of control structures."&lt;SEP&gt;"The error in the student's code stems from incorrect use of control structures (nested loops and boolean flags), leading to flawed logic in matrix evaluation."&lt;SEP&gt;"The student's error stems from incorrect use of control structures—nested if and for loops with improper flag resetting and condition evaluation—leading to faulty logic in determining matrix properties."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-7cf7f0bfd527dd66d9327c11fa6b3ebc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea00e0f2c81dc0fc8cf34f9d8c29edd8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db56fdcd4cd90d637f9116210b9583eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58405284c20a01544e57eb86dc25e81f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6eb1e0de0dc9a052c0705514de52b278&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c7dfd3259ceb2fa5de7585826b8c564</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
