      <data key="d3">16.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The 2D array a[i][j] likely represents a graph adjacency matrix, and the student's attempt to check for connectivity or node properties (via &gt;1 conditions) is flawed, suggesting misunderstanding of graph representation."&lt;SEP&gt;"The error suggests the student misapplied graph-like connectivity rules (e.g., row/column/diagonal checks) when determining valid states, possibly confusing adjacency with independent conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The problem involves a 2D array, not a graph — the student does not attempt to model relationships as nodes/edges, so no relevant understanding or misunderstanding is present."</data>
