      <data key="d5">chunk-894984c1101b01ce3f960a1ef34f426a</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;STUDENT&quot;" target="&quot;KNOWLEDGE POINTS&quot;">
      <data key="d3">38.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The student's performance on the problem reflects their mastery level of specific knowledge points, with unmentioned points assumed to be understood."&lt;SEP&gt;"The student's performance on the submission reflects their grasp or lack thereof of specific knowledge points, with unmentioned points assumed to be understood."&lt;SEP&gt;"The student's performance on this submission implies mastery of knowledge points not mentioned in the error description, and misunderstanding of those that are."&lt;SEP&gt;"The student's understanding is measured against specific knowledge points, with correct responses indicating mastery."&lt;SEP&gt;"The student’s grasp of knowledge points is inferred from whether they are mentioned or absent in the error description."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-15c4a600bf65356d8978132856a878e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d1c99dbe41c2510b20494b2f7fd5ba7e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e3ecf33dc047b7d1aeaea74b69b6556a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-38cbf6e525bbd6a2cabb176b11d77cb5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-725789acf7c08a6f0c7c8cab1e7f5ea4</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;STUDENT&quot;" target="&quot;RECORD ID: 71-1&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The student's submission is uniquely identified by Record ID: 71-1, linking the individual's performance to this specific record in the system."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-38cbf6e525bbd6a2cabb176b11d77cb5</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;STUDENT&quot;" target="&quot;2025-01-23 16:51:58&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The student's incorrect response occurred at the exact timestamp 2025-01-23 16:51:58, anchoring the learning event in time."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-38cbf6e525bbd6a2cabb176b11d77cb5</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;STUDENT&quot;" target="&quot;ERROR SUBMISSION RECORD 72-1&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The student is the subject of the error submission record, which documents their incorrect answer and associated misunderstanding."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-d1c99dbe41c2510b20494b2f7fd5ba7e</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;STUDENT&quot;" target="&quot;BAD: [DESCRIPTION]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The student's submission triggered the 'Bad: [description]' error label, indicating their misunderstanding of the material."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-d1c99dbe41c2510b20494b2f7fd5ba7e</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;STUDENT&quot;" target="&quot;ERROR SUBMISSION RECORD 73-1&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The student is the subject of the submission event, whose incorrect answer triggered the error description and performance evaluation."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-e3ecf33dc047b7d1aeaea74b69b6556a</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;STUDENT&quot;" target="&quot;STUDENT'S PROGRAM&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The student is the user or operator of the program that encountered an error, establishing direct involvement."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-a59784eb0e438c2be374884ef3182f5c</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;STUDENT&quot;" target="&quot;2025-01-23 16:52:52&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The student's error was recorded at this specific timestamp, linking the person to the event."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-a59784eb0e438c2be374884ef3182f5c</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;STUDENT&quot;" target="&quot;RECORD ID: 74-1&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The student's error is formally recorded under this unique record ID, establishing a direct administrative link between the person and the log event."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-a59784eb0e438c2be374884ef3182f5c</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;STUDENT&quot;" target="&quot;ENTITY EXTRACTION PROBLEM&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The student is directly engaged in solving the entity extraction problem by submitting a program and error description as part of their academic work."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-57ee1a1a5e05863089845c9fa1f50c0e</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;STUDENT&quot;" target="&quot;SUBMISSION SYSTEM&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The student uses the submission system to upload their work, which is then logged with a unique record ID and timestamp."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-57ee1a1a5e05863089845c9fa1f50c0e</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;STUDENT&quot;" target="&quot;79-2&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Record ID 79-2 uniquely identifies the student's submission within the system, serving as a reference to their work on the entity extraction problem."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-57ee1a1a5e05863089845c9fa1f50c0e</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;STUDENT&quot;" target="&quot;RECORD ID: 80-2&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The student is the subject of Record ID: 80-2, whose performance is documented and evaluated at this specific timestamp."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-37700e6b965dc09fe5f8a9761da4d8f8</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;STUDENT&quot;" target="&quot;SUBMISSION&quot;">
      <data key="d3">54.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The student creates and submits a response, which becomes the submission evaluated by the educational assessment system."&lt;SEP&gt;"The student is the author of the submission, which includes their program and error description used for evaluation."&lt;SEP&gt;"The student's submission is the artifact being analyzed to determine mastery level, directly linked to their performance."&lt;SEP&gt;"The student produces the submission, which is then evaluated for understanding using 'Good' or 'Bad' markers."&lt;SEP&gt;"The student performs the submission, which is the primary artifact evaluated for mastery of knowledge points."&lt;SEP&gt;"The student is the author of the submission, which contains their program and error response, used to evaluate their understanding."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-15c4a600bf65356d8978132856a878e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-26b0d0ed2ff7cae6f89f08cce6fe3a3e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0747c1df78c5777327fecd87fccd7d6c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-37700e6b965dc09fe5f8a9761da4d8f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-725789acf7c08a6f0c7c8cab1e7f5ea4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b80c6952ceb5bde1a528cf5c85d2c25a</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;STUDENT&quot;" target="&quot;GOOD&quot;">
      <data key="d3">17.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The 'Good' label is assigned to the student's submission when their understanding of knowledge points is demonstrated without errors."&lt;SEP&gt;"The student is associated with the 'Good' event when their submission correctly demonstrates understanding of one or more knowledge points without errors."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-0e25d2145ec23366f1eef2a7d47f3400&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f4bd0ea17b3929365d93428c4298f84</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;STUDENT&quot;" target="&quot;BAD&quot;">
      <data key="d3">17.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The 'Bad' label is assigned to the student's submission when error details indicate misunderstanding or lack of understanding of knowledge points."&lt;SEP&gt;"The student is associated with the 'Bad' event when their submission contains error details indicating misunderstanding or lack of understanding of a knowledge point."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-0e25d2145ec23366f1eef2a7d47f3400&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f4bd0ea17b3929365d93428c4298f84</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
