      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The student is the subject of the submission identified by Record ID: 104-2, and their performance is recorded and evaluated under this identifier."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-3f4bd0ea17b3929365d93428c4298f84</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;NONE&quot;" target="&quot;RECORD ID: 93-1&quot;">
      <data key="d3">1.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Record ID: 93-1 is an event tied to the evaluation process, but no organization, person, or geo is referenced in the text to form a relationship."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-e63727f4e6de917ca04b71090f90f193</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;EVALUATION PROCESS&quot;" target="&quot;RECORD ID: 39-2&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The evaluation process is documented and identified by Record ID: 39-2, which serves as a unique reference for this specific instance."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-11fe621a78672955859dc64967ef6101</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;MID&quot;" target="&quot;PI SUM[5]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"PI sum[5]用于评估多个mid候选值的代价，是学生尝试优化mid选择的策略体现，但实现中存在索引越界和逻辑混乱。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-ce2daaa3fa89648dcc0d0bc91f132ea2</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ORIGINAL ENTITY EXTRACTION PROMPT&quot;" target="&quot;DIFFERENT SUBMISSIONS&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The original entity extraction prompt is the basis for evaluating different submissions of the same problem, indicating its central role in the assessment process."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-676b80a33efec9486dac2ad40fd0dadb</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ORIGINAL ENTITY EXTRACTION PROMPT&quot;" target="&quot;STUDENT'S PROGRAM&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The student's program is designed to implement or respond to the original entity extraction prompt, making the prompt the foundational instruction for the program's functionality."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-676b80a33efec9486dac2ad40fd0dadb</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;RECORD ID&quot;" target="&quot;TIMESTAMP&quot;">
      <data key="d3">18.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Record ID 78-1 is uniquely associated with the timestamp 2025-01-24 16:44:17 to ensure traceability of the evaluation event."&lt;SEP&gt;"Record ID and Timestamp are linked metadata entries that together uniquely identify and timestamp a specific submission or evaluation event in the system."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-676b80a33efec9486dac2ad40fd0dadb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd0fe469f0b31315b1804ec571d8c427</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;RECORD ID&quot;" target="&quot;STUDENT'S PROGRAM&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Record ID is associated with the student's program as its unique identifier within the evaluation system, linking the submission to its corresponding assessment."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-676b80a33efec9486dac2ad40fd0dadb</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;STUDENT'S PROGRAM&quot;" target="&quot;2025-01-23 16:52:52&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The program error occurred and was logged at this timestamp, making the event directly tied to the program."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-a59784eb0e438c2be374884ef3182f5c</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;STUDENT'S PROGRAM&quot;" target="&quot;RECORD ID: 74-1&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The program error that occurred is cataloged under this record ID, making it the primary reference point for the incident."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-a59784eb0e438c2be374884ef3182f5c</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;哈希&quot;" target="&quot;搜索&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"哈希结构支撑搜索的效率，防止重复访问状态，使搜索在有限时间内收敛，是搜索算法正确性和性能的关键保障。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-8777998ec25d22d1bd1539ed5e957781</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;贪心&quot;" target="&quot;绝对差之和&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"学生程序使用绝对差之和作为贪心策略的评估函数，选择使该和最小的候选值作为目标，体现了贪心思想的应用。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-20ddc86ac0009d54376fa7021861c400</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;贪心&quot;" target="&quot;字符串外串&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"构造满足可爱度m的字符串可采用贪心策略（如最小化字符种类），但需结合不连续子序列的结构约束，学生未能正确应用。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-93f661a79bff9e316801a96e64c29dc7</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;RECORD ID: 41-1&quot;" target="&quot;PROBLEM SUBMISSION&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Record ID: 41-1 is a unique identifier for a specific problem submission event, linking metadata to the submission instance."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-f40243f32ee564d32d9c3cdd1ac7b983</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;RECORD ID: 41-1&quot;" target="&quot;EVALUATION SYSTEM&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The evaluation system generates and manages unique record IDs like 41-1 to track individual submissions for assessment and audit."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-f40243f32ee564d32d9c3cdd1ac7b983</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;PROBLEM SUBMISSION&quot;" target="&quot;EVALUATION SYSTEM&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The problem submission is processed and assessed by the evaluation system, which applies consistent criteria to judge performance."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-f40243f32ee564d32d9c3cdd1ac7b983</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;中位数&quot;" target="&quot;绝对差之和&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"中位数是使绝对差之和最小的最优目标值，学生程序基于此数学性质构建计算逻辑。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-20ddc86ac0009d54376fa7021861c400</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;中位数&quot;" target="&quot;数组分割&quot;">
      <data key="d3">6.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"学生程序中使用中位数作为分割和目标的依据，试图将数组分为两组并各自匹配中位数，但未确保最终仅保留两种元素，造成逻辑断裂。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-20ddc86ac0009d54376fa7021861c400</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;41-2&quot;" target="&quot;2025-01-21 16:41:21&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The record ID 41-2 is associated with the specific evaluation event occurring at the timestamp 2025-01-21 16:41:21, indicating institutional tracking of the evaluation process."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-470b1b64a1d950c7b3b6c987e4a737e9</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;41-2&quot;" target="&quot;EVALUATION&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The evaluation event is recorded and tracked under the record ID 41-2, indicating institutional documentation of the assessment."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-470b1b64a1d950c7b3b6c987e4a737e9</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;EVALUATION&quot;" target="&quot;EDUCATIONAL ASSESSMENT&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The evaluation is the specific instance of the broader educational assessment process, occurring at the recorded timestamp."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-cd0fe469f0b31315b1804ec571d8c427</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;EVALUATION&quot;" target="&quot;78-1&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The record identifier 78-1 uniquely links to the evaluation event, allowing for retrieval and tracking of the assessment result."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-cd0fe469f0b31315b1804ec571d8c427</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;N 行 N 列矩阵&quot;" target="&quot;好矩阵&quot;">
      <data key="d3">118.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"n 行 n 列矩阵是待转换的初始状态，好矩阵是目标状态，二者通过相邻字符交换操作建立转换关系。"&lt;SEP&gt;"n行n列矩阵是待转换的输入，好矩阵是期望的输出状态，二者构成问题的核心转换关系。"&lt;SEP&gt;"学生程序的目标是将输入的n行n列矩阵通过交换操作转化为好矩阵，二者是输入与目标状态的转换关系。"&lt;SEP&gt;"输入的 n 行 n 列矩阵需要通过一系列相邻交换操作转化为‘好矩阵’这一目标状态。"&lt;SEP&gt;"给定的 n 行 n 列矩阵是初始状态，必须通过相邻交换操作转换为目标状态‘好矩阵’，二者构成问题中的状态转换关系。"&lt;SEP&gt;"给定的n行n列矩阵是初始状态，通过相邻交换操作被转换为目标状态‘好矩阵’，二者是问题中的输入与输出关系。"&lt;SEP&gt;"给定的n行n列矩阵需通过相邻交换操作被转化为好矩阵，二者是初始状态与目标状态的关系。"&lt;SEP&gt;"学生程序的目标是将原始的n行n列矩阵通过相邻交换操作转化为‘好矩阵’，二者是输入与目标输出的转换关系。"&lt;SEP&gt;"给定的 n 行 n 列矩阵需要通过相邻交换操作被转换为‘好矩阵’，二者是初始状态与目标状态的对应关系。"&lt;SEP&gt;"给定的 n 行 n 列矩阵需要通过操作被转换为目标事件‘好矩阵’，二者是初始状态与目标状态的直接关系。"&lt;SEP&gt;"给定的 n 行 n 列矩阵需要通过操作被转换为目标事件‘好矩阵’，二者是操作前后的状态关系。"&lt;SEP&gt;"给定的 n 行 n 列矩阵是待转换的初始状态，好矩阵是其目标状态，二者是操作前后的对应关系。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-3b731333a385835804dfd4d80ce0f116&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44413f301feabb11269b4dc39c5222e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bf97b3ffe5b076b009e7bd3766ab5ff8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63ae00dd7b87111567e7a60bf8a5b446&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34f50176f8b78d245242c999fcfe00f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a6025949968addfd629ffba156975574&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-149cbf20a38db662126124752f186e78&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6498d4b9b73c6042d086d98534de214&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e928027976f9566a19f73c1a7c62fce5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b114d72fb1df4b15a6815afb987ada0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f38a167365a5d0276ffb59f1c81ca944&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ae919ec47abcddaf06ba6ba075881e6b</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;N 行 N 列矩阵&quot;" target="&quot;左上、右上、左下、右下四个区域&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"n×n 矩阵被几何划分为这四个区域，其字符分布是否符合‘左上全1、其余全0’的规则，直接决定矩阵是否为‘好矩阵’。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-751de14de4f6fd0795902684f69fa4d1</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;好矩阵&quot;" target="&quot;N 行 N 列 01 矩阵&quot;">
      <data key="d3">30.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"n行n列01矩阵是需要被转换的初始状态，而好矩阵是目标状态，二者构成问题中的输入-输出变换关系，通过相邻字符交换操作实现转化。"&lt;SEP&gt;"初始的 n 行 n 列 01 矩阵需要通过相邻交换操作被转换为目标状态‘好矩阵’，二者是操作前后的状态关系。"&lt;SEP&gt;"给定的 01 矩阵需要通过相邻交换操作被转换为目标状态‘好矩阵’，二者是初始状态与目标状态的转换关系。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-7545db3cc1ccecefc971d68863f9d5d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db8545487dac8cc471629adfdae25139&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f4fbb8a3d02558286f8c4e5541d666a</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;好矩阵&quot;" target="&quot;LEFT-UPPER REGION&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The left-upper region being entirely filled with '1's is a necessary and defining condition for the matrix to be classified as a '好矩阵'."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-8f4fbb8a3d02558286f8c4e5541d666a</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;好矩阵&quot;" target="&quot;OTHER THREE REGIONS&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The requirement that the other three regions contain only '0's is a critical condition for the matrix to qualify as a '好矩阵'."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-8f4fbb8a3d02558286f8c4e5541d666a</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;好矩阵&quot;" target="&quot;PROBLEM SOLVING PROCESS&quot;">
      <data key="d3">20.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The problem solving process is explicitly aimed at achieving the '好矩阵' state through valid operations, making it the procedural path to the target event."&lt;SEP&gt;"The problem solving process is the sequence of steps aimed at achieving the '好矩阵' state through valid operations."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-db8545487dac8cc471629adfdae25139&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f4fbb8a3d02558286f8c4e5541d666a</data>
