    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;KNOWLEDGE POINTS&quot;" target="&quot;BAD&quot;">
      <data key="d3">19.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The 'Bad' label is triggered when error descriptions reveal gaps or misconceptions in the student's grasp of knowledge points."&lt;SEP&gt;"The presence of errors in the error description indicates the student has not mastered one or more knowledge points, triggering the 'Bad' label."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-3f4bd0ea17b3929365d93428c4298f84&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b80c6952ceb5bde1a528cf5c85d2c25a</data>
