      <data key="d3">20.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The mastery level is derived directly from the analysis of the submission, including the student's program and error description."&lt;SEP&gt;"The mastery level is directly determined by the evaluation of the submission via the error description, labeling it as 'Good' or 'Bad'."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-0747c1df78c5777327fecd87fccd7d6c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b80c6952ceb5bde1a528cf5c85d2c25a</data>
