      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Although not true DP, the use of ans1 and Min to track and update optimal results across multiple BFS calls reflects a dynamic optimization pattern."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-cc25d09f19797d7b290144c34c7eb8b1</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;BFS&quot;" target="&quot;CONTROL STRUCTURE&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Control structures (loops, conditionals) manage the BFS loop, queue operations, and boundary checks essential for correct traversal."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-cc25d09f19797d7b290144c34c7eb8b1</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;BFS&quot;" target="&quot;STD::QUEUE&lt;PI&gt;&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"std::queue&lt;PI&gt; 是 bfs 算法的核心数据结构，用于管理待访问的坐标节点。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-a0e2ac3fe25900f76cfe73eedcd9570d</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;BFS&quot;" target="&quot;DX[] 和 DY[]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"dx[] 和 dy[] 为 bfs 算法提供方向支持，使其能在网格中向四个方向扩展搜索。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-a0e2ac3fe25900f76cfe73eedcd9570d</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;BFS&quot;" target="&quot;CNT1 AND CNT2&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The variables cnt1 and cnt2 are computed within the bfs function to measure component size and boundary water cells during each search iteration."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-a4117c59b410de1711656865bd10cb59</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;BFS&quot;" target="&quot;小L的数学题&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"BFS是学生用来解决小L数学题的算法方法，通过状态遍历判断可达性。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-ccb9086dce37a69e62b6fe93d738da78</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;BFS&quot;" target="&quot;STD::QUEUE&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"std::queue是实现BFS算法的关键数据结构，用于管理待探索的状态队列。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-ccb9086dce37a69e62b6fe93d738da78</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;BFS&quot;" target="&quot;STD::UNORDERED_SET&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"std::unordered_set用于在BFS中记录已访问状态，防止循环和重复计算。"</data>
