      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;BFS&quot;" target="&quot;STD::MAP&lt;INT , INT&gt; F&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The bfs function uses std::map&lt;int, int&gt; f to avoid revisiting numbers during search, but its incorrect declaration causes the program to fail."</data>
