    <edge source="&quot;BFS ALGORITHM&quot;" target="&quot;GRID SEARCH PROBLEM&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The BFS Algorithm is the core method applied to solve the Grid Search Problem, traversing connected components and calculating required counts."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-894984c1101b01ce3f960a1ef34f426a</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;BFS ALGORITHM&quot;" target="&quot;GRID&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The grid serves as the input structure for the BFS Algorithm, which traverses connected 1s and counts adjacent 0s to determine the optimal solution."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-894984c1101b01ce3f960a1ef34f426a</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;BFS ALGORITHM&quot;" target="&quot;VISITED ARRAY&quot;">
      <data key="d3">19.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The visited array is essential to the BFS algorithm to prevent revisiting nodes and avoid infinite loops."&lt;SEP&gt;"The visited array is used by the BFS Algorithm to prevent cycles and ensure each cell is processed once, which is correctly implemented."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-894984c1101b01ce3f960a1ef34f426a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a4117c59b410de1711656865bd10cb59</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;BFS ALGORITHM&quot;" target="&quot;DX AND DY ARRAYS&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The dx and dy arrays define the four-directional movement in BFS, correctly enabling neighbor exploration in the grid."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-894984c1101b01ce3f960a1ef34f426a</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;BFS ALGORITHM&quot;" target="&quot;GRID GRAPH&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The BFS algorithm is applied on a grid graph structure where each cell is a node with up to four directional edges."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-a4117c59b410de1711656865bd10cb59</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;BFS ALGORITHM&quot;" target="&quot;COUNTER VARIABLES CNT1 AND CNT2&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The BFS algorithm uses cnt1 and cnt2 to accumulate statistics about connected components and their boundaries during traversal."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-a4117c59b410de1711656865bd10cb59</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;GRID SEARCH PROBLEM&quot;" target="&quot;ANS1 AND MIN VARIABLES&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"ans1 and Min are used to track the largest connected component and its minimum adjacent zero count, forming the core output logic of the Grid Search Problem."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-894984c1101b01ce3f960a1ef34f426a</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;VISITED ARRAY&quot;" target="&quot;VIS&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The vis array is the implementation of the visited control structure used to prevent reprocessing of nodes in BFS."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-a4117c59b410de1711656865bd10cb59</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ANS1 AND MIN VARIABLES&quot;" target="&quot;COUNTER VARIABLES CNT1 AND CNT2&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The values of cnt1 and cnt2 from each BFS run are compared against ans1 and Min to track the optimal component size and minimum boundary."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-a4117c59b410de1711656865bd10cb59</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;2025-01-23 13:49:22&quot;" target="&quot;62-2&quot;">
      <data key="d3">17.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The record ID 62-2 is associated with the timestamp 2025-01-23 13:49:22, indicating when the submission was logged."&lt;SEP&gt;"The record ID 62-2 is temporally linked to the timestamp 2025-01-23 13:49:22, establishing when this specific student submission was recorded in the system."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-9e14c1d7f404ce9578e01e19f11a846b</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;GRID GRAPH&quot;" target="&quot;A&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The grid array 'a' is the concrete representation of the grid graph, where cell values determine node existence and connectivity."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-a4117c59b410de1711656865bd10cb59</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;DX&quot;" target="&quot;DY&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"dx and dy are complementary arrays that together define the four possible movement directions (up, down, left, right) for grid traversal in BFS."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-a4117c59b410de1711656865bd10cb59</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A&quot;" target="&quot;A⊕B=C&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"a是构成目标事件a⊕b=c的两个关键操作数之一，其位状态直接影响异或结果是否等于c。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-2e96fe33a652d98236ab6e39e9022dc7</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A&quot;" target="&quot;反置操作&quot;">
      <data key="d3">17.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"a 可通过反置操作改变其单个位的值，是反置操作的直接作用对象。"&lt;SEP&gt;"a是反置操作的直接作用对象，其每一位可被独立翻转以调整与b的异或结果。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-2e96fe33a652d98236ab6e39e9022dc7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-545d80205967186bbfce4955f69aa723</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A&quot;" target="&quot;交换操作&quot;">
      <data key="d3">32.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"a 可通过交换操作调整其位的位置分布，是交换操作的直接作用对象。"&lt;SEP&gt;"a是交换操作的直接作用对象，其数位可被重新排列以优化异或结果。"&lt;SEP&gt;"a 是交换操作的直接操作对象，其任意两位可被交换以重新排列位模式。"&lt;SEP&gt;"交换操作通过重排 a 的位序，间接影响 a⊕b 的结果，是优化成本结构的重要操作。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-2e96fe33a652d98236ab6e39e9022dc7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-545d80205967186bbfce4955f69aa723&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-740455e328e2f67f25cee018470473d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a51b47f04a5032a9117dced97c6aa7a6</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A&quot;" target="&quot;A ⊕ B = C&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"a 是构成目标事件 a ⊕ b = c 的核心操作对象之一，其位状态直接影响异或结果。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-545d80205967186bbfce4955f69aa723</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A&quot;" target="&quot;小L&quot;">
      <data key="d3">16.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"小L 是操作对象 a 的管理者，需通过操作使其满足目标条件，是问题的直接解决者。"&lt;SEP&gt;"小L是直接操作二进制数a的学生，通过位运算修改a以达成目标."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-545d80205967186bbfce4955f69aa723&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-337f6c50a6fc0269c78db8502813c381</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A&quot;" target="&quot;翻转操作&quot;">
      <data key="d3">17.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"a 是翻转操作的直接操作对象，其每一位可被独立翻转以调整异或结果。"&lt;SEP&gt;"翻转操作可直接修改 a 的任意一位，是改变 a 值以逼近 a⊕b=c 的基本操作手段。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-740455e328e2f67f25cee018470473d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a51b47f04a5032a9117dced97c6aa7a6</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A&quot;" target="&quot;C&quot;">
      <data key="d3">35.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The goal is to transform a (via operations) such that when XORed with b, the result equals c, making a directly linked to c through the XOR constraint."&lt;SEP&gt;"The goal is to transform a (via operations) such that when XORed with b, the result equals c; a is directly modified to meet this constraint."&lt;SEP&gt;"a 与 c 通过异或关系间接关联，目标是使 a⊕b 的结果等于 c，因此 a 的每一位变化直接影响是否达成目标。"&lt;SEP&gt;"a 的最终状态必须与 b 的状态共同满足 a⊕b=c，因此 a 的每一位变化直接影响 c 的可达成性。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-5c558efa82eea3b35fae76cbadb1eff6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-740455e328e2f67f25cee018470473d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-337f6c50a6fc0269c78db8502813c381&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a51b47f04a5032a9117dced97c6aa7a6</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A&quot;" target="&quot;B&quot;">
      <data key="d3">40.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"a and b are the two binary numbers whose XOR must equal c; their bits are manipulated jointly through operations to achieve the target."&lt;SEP&gt;"a and b are the two binary numbers whose XOR result must equal c; their bits are manipulated through operations to achieve the target."&lt;SEP&gt;"a 和 b 是异或运算的两个输入，它们的每一位组合决定异或结果，是达成 c 的共同基础。"&lt;SEP&gt;"a 和 b 是两个待操作的二进制数，它们的异或结果必须等于 c，二者通过翻转和交换操作相互影响以达成目标。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-5c558efa82eea3b35fae76cbadb1eff6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-740455e328e2f67f25cee018470473d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-337f6c50a6fc0269c78db8502813c381&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a51b47f04a5032a9117dced97c6aa7a6</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A&quot;" target="&quot;N 位二进制数&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"a 是 n 位二进制数的具体实例，其长度 n 决定了操作的规模和复杂度。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-740455e328e2f67f25cee018470473d4</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A&quot;" target="&quot;按位异或运算 (⊕)&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"按位异或运算是定义 a 与结果 c 之间关系的核心数学操作，a 的所有变化都必须满足该运算规则。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-a51b47f04a5032a9117dced97c6aa7a6</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A&quot;" target="&quot;Y&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The cost y governs how expensive it is to swap any two bits in a, enabling reordering of bits at higher cost than flipping."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-337f6c50a6fc0269c78db8502813c381</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A&quot;" target="&quot;位运算&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"位运算事件包括对二进制数a进行反置和交换位的操作，是实现a⊕b=c目标的核心操作对象."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-337f6c50a6fc0269c78db8502813c381</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;F&quot;" target="&quot;A[I][J]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The value of a[i][j] is compared to 1 to determine the state of flag f, forming the core condition in the simulation logic."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-7cf7f0bfd527dd66d9327c11fa6b3ebc</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;F&quot;" target="&quot;FLAG&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The final flag depends on the state of f across iterations, but f is not reset properly between loops, corrupting the final flag value."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-7cf7f0bfd527dd66d9327c11fa6b3ebc</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;MIN&quot;" target="&quot;Y&quot;">
      <data key="d3">6.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Min indirectly affects the y-term by determining the range (Cnt - Min) over which y is applied, linking the two variables through conditional logic."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-64a0b2fc78e14ac24b3790b183153e20</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;字符串外串&quot;" target="&quot;字符串算法&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"‘字符串外串’问题本质上是一个字符串算法问题，涉及子串与特殊定义子序列的匹配与构造。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-93f661a79bff9e316801a96e64c29dc7</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;字符串外串&quot;" target="&quot;可爱度&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"可爱度是‘字符串外串’事件的核心计算目标，整个问题围绕如何构造字符串使其可爱度恰好等于 m 展开。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-d2076568b2623a983fd25582f3fa50c6</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;字符串外串&quot;" target="&quot;不连续子序列&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"‘字符串外串’事件的核心在于识别不连续子序列与连续子串的匹配，是该事件的定义基础。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-fc7bcf65aa4562f02e59c3d8969ea961</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;字符串外串&quot;" target="&quot;连续子串&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"‘字符串外串’事件依赖于连续子串的存在，作为与不连续子序列比较的对象，构成可爱度计算的双重要素。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-fc7bcf65aa4562f02e59c3d8969ea961</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;NIU KELE&quot;" target="&quot;STRING CUTENESS&quot;">
      <data key="d3">27.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Niu Kele defines the concept of string cuteness, making them the originator of this specific computational problem event."&lt;SEP&gt;"Niu Kele is the originator of the String Cuteness definition and problem formulation."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-465db4ec94fa4f2a3c4c7e2cee8d5ddb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-886d290d1e72e5c4612a7a2f92b3deda</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;连续子串&quot;" target="&quot;可爱度&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"连续子串是计算可爱度的必要组成部分，必须与不连续子序列长度相等且内容相同。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-d2076568b2623a983fd25582f3fa50c6</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;连续子串&quot;" target="&quot;不连续子序列&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"连续子串与不连续子序列必须完全相等才能贡献于可爱度，二者是‘字符串外串’事件中必须匹配的两个结构。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-d2076568b2623a983fd25582f3fa50c6</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;不连续子序列&quot;" target="&quot;可爱度&quot;">
      <data key="d3">20.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"不连续子序列是定义可爱度的另一个必要组成部分，其特殊结构（至少两段不相邻子串）是区别于普通子序列的关键。"&lt;SEP&gt;"可爱度 is defined by the existence of a non-contiguous subsequence of length k matching a substring, making the subsequence a necessary component of the concept."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-113dd897ceb7d892e27e4255ac1852cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d2076568b2623a983fd25582f3fa50c6</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;可爱度&quot;" target="&quot;子串&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"可爱度 is defined by the existence of a substring of length k, making the substring a necessary component of the concept."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-113dd897ceb7d892e27e4255ac1852cd</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;YES&quot;" target="&quot;A.CPP&quot;">
      <data key="d3">6.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"a.cpp程序在满足条件时输出'YES'并构造字符串，表明其意图实现构造性解法，但因语法错误无法正常运行。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-9b7fdb13d220397bc7332d07c7cfc57e</data>
