    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;YES&quot;" target="&quot;STRING T&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"When 'YES' is output, the program intends to construct and print string t, linking the decision to the actual output solution."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-9b7fdb13d220397bc7332d07c7cfc57e</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
