      <data key="d3">65.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Tokitsukaze activates the Dragon's Breath ability to defeat monsters on the grid, making her the user of this event."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze is the user of the Dragon's Breath ability, activating it to defeat monsters on the grid map."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze is the user of the Dragon's Breath ability, activating it to defeat monsters on the grid."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze is the user of the Dragon's Breath ability, activating it to defeat monsters on the grid."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze is the user of the Dragon's Breath ability, actively deploying it to maximize monster elimination."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze is the user of the Dragon's Breath ability, directing it to maximize monster elimination."</data>
