      <data key="d3">68.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Dragon's Breath is an ability that acts upon the grid map, affecting cells along diagonal lines to destroy monsters."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath is an ability that operates on the grid map, affecting cells along diagonal lines based on the chosen coordinate."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath is an ability that operates on the grid map, affecting cells along diagonal lines centered at a chosen coordinate."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath is an ability that operates specifically on the grid map, affecting cells along diagonal lines from a selected coordinate."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath is an ability that operates specifically on the Grid Map, affecting cells along diagonal lines based on the targeted coordinate."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath is applied on the grid map, and its effect is defined by the grid's coordinates and monster distribution."</data>
