      <data key="d3">17.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"sum[0][i] is a precomputed value used to efficiently calculate the total monsters destroyed along one diagonal of Dragon's Breath."&lt;SEP&gt;"sum[0][i] precomputes diagonal sums to optimize the calculation of Dragon's Breath damage along one diagonal direction."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-6ab3ebf5f1287dbbf9a2ec35fad95eea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89dd6bd1e7fef4152822627f117d0a69</data>
