    <edge source="&quot;DRAGON'S BREATH&quot;" target="&quot;A_{I,J}&quot;">
      <data key="d3">20.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Dragon's Breath destroys monsters at each cell (i,j) whose count is stored in a_{i,j}, making it the core data source for damage calculation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath destroys monsters by summing the values of a_{i,j} along all diagonal paths it covers."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-411bbe91994001030c7a545311f4d2a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ab3ebf5f1287dbbf9a2ec35fad95eea</data>
