      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Dragon's Breath is centered at a selected coordinate (x,y), which determines the origin and spread of the diagonal flame pattern."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-31762007a2e73f9fb552da2a60ea057a</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;GRID MAP&quot;" target="&quot;A_{I,J}&quot;">
      <data key="d3">20.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The Grid Map's content is defined by the values a_{i,j}, which specify the number of monsters at each cell."&lt;SEP&gt;"The grid map's content is fully described by the values a_{i,j} at each coordinate, which determine the total damage possible from Dragon's Breath."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-30fcdbc4a46340504623e14c8b57c676&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89dd6bd1e7fef4152822627f117d0a69</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;GRID MAP&quot;" target="&quot;A[M][M]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"a[M][M] is the data structure that holds the monster counts for each cell of the Grid Map, making it the foundational representation of the map."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-6ab3ebf5f1287dbbf9a2ec35fad95eea</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;GRID MAP&quot;" target="&quot;B[M][M]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"b[M][M] is a temporary transposed version of the Grid Map used to standardize computation when the grid is taller than it is wide."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-6ab3ebf5f1287dbbf9a2ec35fad95eea</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;GRID MAP&quot;" target="&quot;N ROWS AND M COLUMNS&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The dimensions n and m define the size and boundaries of the grid map, constraining where Dragon's Breath can be applied and which cells are valid targets."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-31762007a2e73f9fb552da2a60ea057a</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A_{I,J}&quot;" target="&quot;SUM&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Sum accumulates values of a_{i,j} along diagonal paths to compute the total damage of Dragon's Breath."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-89dd6bd1e7fef4152822627f117d0a69</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A_{I,J}&quot;" target="&quot;SUM[0][I]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"sum[0][i] is derived by summing a_{i,j} values along specific diagonals to optimize Dragon's Breath calculations."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-89dd6bd1e7fef4152822627f117d0a69</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A_{I,J}&quot;" target="&quot;SUM[1][I]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"sum[1][i] is derived by summing a_{i,j} values along specific diagonals to optimize Dragon's Breath calculations."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-89dd6bd1e7fef4152822627f117d0a69</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A_{I,J}&quot;" target="&quot;SUM2[0][I]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"sum2[0][i] is derived by summing a_{i,j} values along specific diagonals to optimize Dragon's Breath calculations."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-89dd6bd1e7fef4152822627f117d0a69</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A_{I,J}&quot;" target="&quot;SUM2[1][I]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"sum2[1][i] is derived by summing a_{i,j} values along specific diagonals to optimize Dragon's Breath calculations."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-89dd6bd1e7fef4152822627f117d0a69</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A_{I,J}&quot;" target="&quot;COORDINATE (X,Y)&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The value of a_{i,j} at each grid cell along the diagonal paths from (x,y) contributes directly to the total monster count destroyed by Dragon's Breath."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-31762007a2e73f9fb552da2a60ea057a</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;SUM&quot;" target="&quot;A[U][V]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Sum accumulates values from the 2D array a[u][v], but the variable is reused without proper reinitialization in nested loops, causing incorrect totals."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-d2d96c31e95bd2cc22d83070842cc3b9</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;SUM&quot;" target="&quot;DIAGONAL_SUM_COMPUTATION&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Sum is used as a variable to accumulate values during diagonal traversal, directly enabling the Diagonal_Sum_Computation event."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-a3873516dc37339412e6d863d6c0b47f</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;SUM[1][I]&quot;" target="&quot;A[U][V]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Values from a[u][v] are summed and stored in sum[1][i], but the traversal logic (u++, v--) may exceed array bounds when u or v go out of valid range."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-d2d96c31e95bd2cc22d83070842cc3b9</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;SUM[1][I]&quot;" target="&quot;I&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"i determines the column index for storing diagonal sums in sum[1][i], and its iteration range (1 to m) is correctly aligned with the array dimension."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-d2d96c31e95bd2cc22d83070842cc3b9</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;SUM2[0][I]&quot;" target="&quot;A[U][V]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">20.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The elements of a[u][v] are also summed along opposite diagonals and stored in sum2[0][i], establishing a parallel data flow."&lt;SEP&gt;"sum2[0][i] is computed using a downward-left diagonal (u--, v--) with no safeguard against negative indices, likely causing segmentation fault or undefined behavior."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-a3873516dc37339412e6d863d6c0b47f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d2d96c31e95bd2cc22d83070842cc3b9</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;SUM2[0][I]&quot;" target="&quot;CODE EXECUTION ERROR&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The computation of sum2[0][i] uses unbounded decrements (u--, v--) without checking for zero or negative bounds, directly causing the runtime error."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-d2d96c31e95bd2cc22d83070842cc3b9</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;SUM2[0][I]&quot;" target="&quot;U&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"u is decremented without bound while computing sum2[0][i], leading to invalid array access and the primary cause of the runtime error."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-d2d96c31e95bd2cc22d83070842cc3b9</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;SUM2[0][I]&quot;" target="&quot;V&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"v is decremented without bound while computing sum2[0][i], resulting in negative indexing and undefined behavior."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-d2d96c31e95bd2cc22d83070842cc3b9</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;SUM2[0][I]&quot;" target="&quot;I&quot;">
      <data key="d3">6.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"i determines the column index for storing diagonal sums in sum2[0][i]; the storage is valid, but the computation for this index is unsafe."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-d2d96c31e95bd2cc22d83070842cc3b9</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;SUM2[1][I]&quot;" target="&quot;A[U][V]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">18.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The elements of a[u][v] are summed along specific diagonals and stored in sum2[1][i], establishing a direct data flow from matrix elements to result storage."&lt;SEP&gt;"Values from a[u][v] are used to compute sum2[1][i] via a diagonal traversal (u--, v++), but the loop condition 'u &amp;&amp; v &lt;= m' may not properly handle edge cases."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-a3873516dc37339412e6d863d6c0b47f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d2d96c31e95bd2cc22d83070842cc3b9</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;SUM2[1][I]&quot;" target="&quot;I&quot;">
      <data key="d3">6.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"i determines the column index for storing diagonal sums in sum2[1][i]; its usage is correct, but the internal computation is flawed."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-d2d96c31e95bd2cc22d83070842cc3b9</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;6+2+10+2+5+9+2=36&quot;" target="&quot;(2,3)&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The sum 36 is the result of applying Dragon's Breath at coordinate (2,3), demonstrating the calculation method for a specific instance."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-30fcdbc4a46340504623e14c8b57c676</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;9+5+8+5=27&quot;" target="&quot;(1,1)&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The sum 27 is the result of applying Dragon's Breath at coordinate (1,1), demonstrating the calculation method for a corner case."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-30fcdbc4a46340504623e14c8b57c676</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;79-2&quot;" target="&quot;2025-02-06 13:54:37&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The record ID 79-2 is directly associated with the timestamp 2025-02-06 13:54:37, indicating when the submission was made and recorded in the system."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-57ee1a1a5e05863089845c9fa1f50c0e</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;79-2&quot;" target="&quot;ENTITY EXTRACTION PROBLEM&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Record ID 79-2 is tied to the student’s solution for the entity extraction problem, making it a key artifact of their attempt."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-57ee1a1a5e05863089845c9fa1f50c0e</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ENTITY EXTRACTION PROBLEM&quot;" target="&quot;SUBMISSION SYSTEM&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The submission system is the medium through which the entity extraction problem is administered and tracked, linking student responses to record identifiers."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-57ee1a1a5e05863089845c9fa1f50c0e</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A[U][V]&quot;" target="&quot;U&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"u directly indexes the first dimension of array a[u][v]; unbounded decrementing of u leads to negative indices and invalid memory access."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-d2d96c31e95bd2cc22d83070842cc3b9</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A[U][V]&quot;" target="&quot;V&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"v directly indexes the second dimension of array a[u][v]; unbounded incrementing or decrementing of v causes out-of-bounds access."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-d2d96c31e95bd2cc22d83070842cc3b9</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;CODE EXECUTION ERROR&quot;" target="&quot;WHILE(U &amp;&amp; V)&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The while(u &amp;&amp; v) loop lacks bounds checking for negative indices, directly triggering the runtime error."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-d2d96c31e95bd2cc22d83070842cc3b9</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;CODE EXECUTION ERROR&quot;" target="&quot;CODE LOGIC FLAW&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The code logic flaw — unbounded index decrements — is the root cause of the runtime error, as it leads to invalid memory accesses."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-d2d96c31e95bd2cc22d83070842cc3b9</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;U&quot;" target="&quot;V&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"u and v are coordinate variables that move in tandem to traverse diagonals in the matrix, forming a paired traversal relationship."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-a3873516dc37339412e6d863d6c0b47f</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;WHILE(U &amp;&amp; V &lt;= M)&quot;" target="&quot;CODE LOGIC FLAW&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The condition 'u &amp;&amp; v &lt;= m' incorrectly assumes u remains non-negative, but u is decremented from n without safeguard, creating a logic flaw."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-d2d96c31e95bd2cc22d83070842cc3b9</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
