      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Diagonal_Sum_Computation is a subset of the broader Matrix_Operation event, which includes initialization, iteration, and result storage."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-a3873516dc37339412e6d863d6c0b47f</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;DIAGONAL PATHS&quot;" target="&quot;MONSTER ELIMINATION&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The diagonal paths define the exact set of grid cells affected by Dragon's Breath, and the sum of monsters on these paths equals the total monster elimination."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-31762007a2e73f9fb552da2a60ea057a</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;MONSTER ELIMINATION&quot;" target="&quot;MAXIMUM MONSTER ELIMINATION&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Maximum Monster Elimination is the optimal result achieved by selecting the best coordinate (x,y) to maximize the total monster elimination across all possible center points."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-31762007a2e73f9fb552da2a60ea057a</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;RECORD ID: 81-2&quot;" target="&quot;2025-02-06 14:07:17&quot;">
      <data key="d3">18.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Record ID: 81-2 is temporally anchored to the timestamp 2025-02-06 14:07:17, which captures the exact moment the student submitted their work for assessment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Record ID: 81-2 is temporally linked to the timestamp 2025-02-06 14:07:17, which captures when the submission was made for evaluation."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-0e25d2145ec23366f1eef2a7d47f3400</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;VAL(A)&quot;" target="&quot;ABSOLUTE EXPECTATION&quot;">
      <data key="d3">40.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Absolute Expectation is the problem event whose goal is to compute the expected value of the function val(a)."&lt;SEP&gt;"Absolute Expectation is the problem event whose solution requires computing the expectation of val(a)."&lt;SEP&gt;"Absolute Expectation is the problem whose goal is to compute the expectation of val(a), making val(a) the central mathematical object of the event."&lt;SEP&gt;"val(a) is the mathematical function defined within the Absolute Expectation event whose expectation is the central computational goal."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-b596842b3f70ab70e198d8ac72878311&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f7b2af6a814bb455302a627bfc1141e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20a84c0c02b3b7d3ef7caf0684c1b178&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-293da72110035eed70da0f418dfa1a2b</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;VAL(A)&quot;" target="&quot;QUERY&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The query function computes the expected contribution of each consecutive pair (a_{i-1}, a_i) to val(a), making it essential for calculating the total expectation."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-9f7b2af6a814bb455302a627bfc1141e</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;L_I&quot;" target="&quot;R_I&quot;">
      <data key="d3">26.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"l_i and r_i together define the interval [l_i, r_i] from which a_i is sampled, forming a paired geometric constraint essential for modeling randomness in the sequence."&lt;SEP&gt;"l_i and r_i together define the interval [l_i, r_i] from which a_i is sampled; they are co-dependent bounds for each random variable."&lt;SEP&gt;"l_i and r_i together define the uniform probability distribution from which each a_i is independently sampled, forming the foundational probabilistic model of the problem."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-b596842b3f70ab70e198d8ac72878311&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f7b2af6a814bb455302a627bfc1141e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20a84c0c02b3b7d3ef7caf0684c1b178</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;L_I&quot;" target="&quot;子区间 [L_I, R_I]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"l_i 是子区间 [l_i, r_i] 的左边界，直接决定该区间的起始位置。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-d3220ac1e2b38ea3962a2cf303acd6f9</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;R_I&quot;" target="&quot;子区间 [L_I, R_I]&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"r_i 是子区间 [l_i, r_i] 的右边界，直接决定该区间的结束位置。"</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-d3220ac1e2b38ea3962a2cf303acd6f9</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;POW&quot;" target="&quot;QUERY&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The Pow function is used within query to compute modular inverses of interval sizes, necessary for normalizing probabilities in modular arithmetic."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-9f7b2af6a814bb455302a627bfc1141e</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;炸鸡&quot;" target="&quot;小L&quot;">
      <data key="d3">278.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"小L and 炸鸡 are opposing players in a tic-tac-toe game, with 炸鸡 granting 小L a special two-move privilege due to 小L's novice status."&lt;SEP&gt;小L与炸鸡之间构建了一种深刻而多维的关系，融合了教育指导与休闲博弈两大核心维度。在学术与技能培养层面，炸鸡作为小L的系统性导师，深入传授了数学与计算领域的关键知识，包括平方与开方的基本运算方法，以及位运算的核心原理——如异或运算（a⊕b=c）的逻辑、二进制操作规则及其在优化问题中的实际应用。这些系统的教学活动为小L奠定了坚实的理论基础，确立了炸鸡在其成长过程中至关重要的教育者角色。

与此同时，在非教学情境中，小L与炸鸡作为对手参与井字棋（tic-tac-toe）游戏。尽管处于竞争关系，炸鸡出于对小L新手身份（novice status）或经验不足的体谅与关怀，主动赋予小L一项特殊优势：允许其在每轮中先行两步，即“两步特权”。这一机制并非削弱游戏的竞争性，而是旨在平衡双方实力，体现了一种兼具策略性与人文温度的互动模式。多个描述一致确认，该优势源于小L的初学者身份，语言表述虽略有差异（如“special advantage”或“special two-move privilege”），但实质内容完全一致，无任何矛盾。

综上所述，炸鸡不仅是小L在数学与计算技能发展中的严谨导师，也是其休闲博弈中富有同理心的对手。二者的关系超越了单纯的师生或对手框架，融合了知识传授、策略包容与情感支持，形成了一种深刻而平衡的多维支持体系。</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-2643532bc65acd10b75f38bdb35830ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-649cc18b2d0fdb15683c43c49f191a5c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf315318fb9435781f726121555b7204&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5e1ff29e648a8e199ea54e1d3f51e580&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5b3750f193faab9aceaa89b9df470e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-337f6c50a6fc0269c78db8502813c381&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-779b6394c3bf1e24a845e4dbfebf7904&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-478ef0557cc0427a88aeac7c8e7fd593&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6bd4eda16155c0a4cb6a2357257e23c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f67ee8387c405a64f0344ed9a4a9305e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c558efa82eea3b35fae76cbadb1eff6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c81dadb0077742b9e0c42699623a7c2c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b256fd1c0676b66deece8e4e49ff37e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2e96fe33a652d98236ab6e39e9022dc7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d34feb8b38494b33de0e8d583302bc5a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-183a7f24059ae22698c59d6bce91789e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-94a277024978e1e9676408dfab4dc3fb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-65da65cd36531d031db5b8f1d3d85dab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ccb9086dce37a69e62b6fe93d738da78&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-054c255dec239c2762b373ecc1e4a1e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2c278038d1b5c766243692d5b0c40bf8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-545d80205967186bbfce4955f69aa723&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a376d30d059b09f44ce6681d11e112d3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea15e123e23c10fb0dd1d2aa46c0de25&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c65c413a0785f44cfb35456d545b19d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fe5877d488b5991002f2148f74e454ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8dc16b5f321438c090a3a2ab6291f38f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a51b47f04a5032a9117dced97c6aa7a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8777998ec25d22d1bd1539ed5e957781&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f761857c7438d0e8234494cb00c030e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9993599a98c4a13ce90be07d75f3c76e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-740455e328e2f67f25cee018470473d4</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
