    <edge source="&quot;TIC-TAC-TOE GAME&quot;" target="&quot;O&quot;">
      <data key="d3">58.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"O is a core game state symbol in the Tic-Tac-Toe Game, indicating 炸鸡's presence and potential winning lines."&lt;SEP&gt;"O is a key state indicator in the tic-tac-toe game, representing 炸鸡's contributions toward forming a winning line."&lt;SEP&gt;"O symbols on the board are key elements in determining winning conditions for 炸鸡 in the tic-tac-toe game."&lt;SEP&gt;"The 'O' marks are central to the objective of the Tic-Tac-Toe Game, as forming three in a row with 'O' leads to victory for 炸鸡."&lt;SEP&gt;"The symbol 'O' is one of the two player markers used in the tic-tac-toe game to determine winning conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"O symbols on the board are key elements defining the current state and potential winning paths in the tic-tac-toe game."&lt;SEP&gt;"The 'O' symbol is one of the two key game markers used to determine winning lines in the tic-tac-toe game."</data>
